:: 'Actually you know what. My Boss threatened to kill me... and sexually attack me. So he should be imprisoned for that. I've got my hand on a bible while writing this. So it's true...' {"position":"2025,800","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "You sign your name across the bottom of document.

'Farewell world...'

That was a really beautiful suicide note.

Bravo!


Now that you've got that out your system, perhaps let's get on with the report. 

We can tuck this note away for now, and come back to it when you need to blow off some steam, yeah?
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
      [[That felt good to get that out. I'm ready to get this report done now! 8 Hours and 10,000 words seems doable now.|That's actually really swell of you to say. Thanks. I guess I have you guys. I'm gonna do the report!]]
      
      [[I'm ready to take the next step. Farewell world!|No actually, the note won't cut it anymore...]]
      
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


