:: ...and my dumb fat face {"position":"550,500","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "It's not fun for me when you talk like that.

Come on...

Fight back a little.

I know the old you.

You know, before you sold your soul to work for this company.

They'd at least defend their weak hips... 

Every day it becomes more and more obvious that you've lost more than time here.

")

