:: 02 {"position":"500,1800","size":"100,100"}
(set: $POOCON to true)
(set: $CHARCREATE to true)
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Hello!

Can you hear me?!

...


This isn't good...


I think the protagonist is unconscious.

Still alive for sure, but I think they've passed out from the pain.


We're going to have to wait until they wake up.


You know this might be the perfect time for some 'Character Creation'. I can't believe we didn't do this at the beginning frankly... and that's on me, sorry.
")

