:: 10,000 words is too much. I'm already exhausted {"position":"1775,150","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "10,000 words for a promotion? 

That sounds like a spiffing deal to me.

Look, no one's forcing you...
")

(if: $SANE is true)[You don't want your sanity back?]

(if: $SUN is true)[You don't want to feel the sun on your back and wind through your hair?]

(if: $PEN is true)[It'll all be worth it when you have your awesome pen back!]

(if: $HIPS is true)[You don't want to fix your weak hips?]

(if: $DINNER is true)[Dinner and a promotion, what can top that?]

