:: 160 bpm {"position":"4900,350","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Your heart is currently beating at 80 bpm.

Are you sure you want to change it to 160 bpm?


If your heart is beating that fast, you'll surely suffer sudden cardiac arrest.


You'll most certainly die.


If you choose 20 bpm, you'll also die... 

I'm sorry.
")

