:: Almost a full day {"position":"550,350","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Thats a long time...

Too long.


A morbid thought pricks your mind. 

You'll probably die here. 

In your office at work.

In your cheap work clothes.

In your stupid little tie you wear.

In your company affirming skin you have on.

With your weak hips...
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
   [[Jesus Christ, I get the picture. You can stop now... and my weak hips have nothing to do with this]]
        
      [[What the fuck is company affirming skin?!]]
 
 [[...and my dumb fat face]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


