:: And what of the woman, in the cave? [Cliff PanelLeft] {"position":"50,8700","size":"100,100"}
Koemi’s jaw tightens.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: She is broken.]

Her eyes lower.

Then drift toward the cave mouth, searching its darkness.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: I tried to rekindle something in her.]

He folds his hands loosely.

(text-colour:lime)[But Koemi is right.]

A small breath.

(text-colour:lime)[She is beyond our help.]

Guyh glances at Rey- briefly.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: We should bring her.]

He sniffs once.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Fresh air is good for the mind.]

(link: "We can't leave her")[
	(set: $HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We can't leave her")
]

(link: "If she wants to stay, that's her choice")[
	(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "So. What's the plan then?1")
]


:: And what of this place... how do we fit into this? [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"350,6650","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: I don't know. 

You’ve seen as much as I have.]

[[You died to get here? Like me?|To get here. You died like me?]]


:: And you trust him?! [PanelLeft Guyh] {"position":"100,7600","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Further up the beach. There was a… creature. Giant. With black wings. It was moving between the eggs, breaking them open, chaining the-]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: There was a child.]

He draws his knees together, folding inward.

His fingers press lightly into his palms.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[She had black, ragged hair.]

His finger lifts gently towards Koemi.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[She looked scared.

She sat with her knees drawn in.]

A faint smile.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Like someone waiting.]

[[And you’re sure it was your sister?]]


:: And you work? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"650,17150","size":"100,100"}
Guyh begins descending the stairs.

Unclothed.

Bare feet against stone.

Each step measured.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: I enjoy conversation.]

He exhales softly.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Too much for my own good.]

The smile fades.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[But you test me.]

He stops an arm’s length from you.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Too much.]

His spine straightens.

His hand extends.

Palm open.

[[Step back]]

[[Drop the ring into his hand]]


:: And you’re sure it was your sister? [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"100,7700","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Perhaps she is yours.] 

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Perhaps not.]

His eyes do not blink.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You will not know... unless you try.]

[[And what do you want?|whatreturn]]


