:: Approach the skeleton [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1125,11525","size":"100,100"}
The skull is propped upright.

Almost proudly.

Parts have been set back into place- bound together with cord.

The bones are polished.

Untouched by fang or claw.

On its wedding finger hangs a gold-crested ring.

Etched with the likeness of a woman.

As your fingers near the bone, the faint warmth in the chamber shifts.

The water in the pool trembles.

A low groan lingers in the air.

[[Withdraw your hand]]

[[Take the ring]]


