:: BEAST [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"2900,12675","size":"100,100"}
No one dares turn their head.

Only eyes move.

It prowls between shadows.

Watching.

Then it freezes.

It sniffs.

It has found the scent.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: DEFILER.]

The scream hangs in the air- more a cry than a roar.

It hesitates-

Then lunges.

You have a heartbeat to act.

[[Drop the ring into the burning 
water|Throw the ring away]]

[[Hold the ring over the burning water]]

(link: "Brandish the ring on your finger. Stand your ground")[
(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 2)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(set: $RollTotal to (random: 1, 6) + (random: 1, 6) + $PERSONA)

	(if: $RollTotal >= 9)[
		(go-to: "Brandish the ring on your finger. Stand your ground")
	](else:)[(set: $HP to 0)
		(go-to: "Brandish the ring on your finger. Stand your groundfail")
	]
]

(set: $RINGLINGERED to true)


