:: Brandish the ring on your finger. Stand your ground [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"3400,12800","size":"100,100"}
Claws shriek against stone as they anchor.

A word splits the chamber.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: NO.]

Saliva spills from its panting jaw.

Out of the corner of your eye, Rey shifts.

Not toward Koemi.

Toward the exit.

[[We are leaving|weleave]]

[[Hold your hand over the burning water]]

(if: $LIKEHIM is true)[ [[You are not her]] ]

(if: $LIKEHIM is true)[ [[You are her]] ]


:: Brandish the ring on your finger. Stand your groundfail [PanelLeft] {"position":"3400,12675","size":"100,100"}
Your composure slips.

Just enough.

You are taken to the ground in an instant.

There is no struggle.

Only fragments.

A woman’s face- pale beneath wet hair.

Framed by vast, inhuman shoulders.

A claw.

Then nothing.

[[…|You Have Died]]
(set: $HP to 0)


