:: Break the silence [PanelLeft] {"position":"975,13800","size":"100,100"}
The silence abides. 

[[Thank you, Koemi]]

[[I owe you my life]]

[[Don't risk your life for me again]]


:: Breath [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"350,6100","size":"100,100"}
The man beside you thanks you, still dragging air into his lungs.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Man: Thank you...]

The woman sits apart.

Close enough to hear.

Far enough to remain untouched by it.

[[Survival is easier together]]

[[Anyone would have]]

[[You owe me nothing]]

[[Don't make me regret it]]


:: Breath1 [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"350,6350","size":"100,100"}
The woman is standing, near a thin crack in cliff face.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: This way.]

[[Wait, you promised answers|Wait, you promised me answers]]


:: Breath2 [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"525,6125","size":"100,100"}
He drags air into his lungs as if he might forget how at any moment.

Savouring each breath.

He steadies.

Then his body remembers.

He winces- a sharp, involuntary sound breaking from his jaw.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Man: My skin… my skin.]

The flesh along his legs is raw and weeping.

He scoops sand over himself, desperate to smother the burn.

The grit grinds into the wounds.

He curls into himself, groaning into the sand.

[[I'm sorry]]

[[Say nothing|Breath2.1]]


:: Breath2.1 [PanelLeft Mundane] {"position":"575,6225","size":"100,100"}
The shoreline laps at the sand, slowly eroding what little might have been said.

You fall silent.

[[...|Breath1]]
