For a heartbeat, the light finds it.

Framed by vast, unnatural shoulders, you glimpse a woman’s face- pale beneath strands of dripping hair.

She does not answer.

A low growl trembles in its chest.

Not at you.

At the castle above.

[[Your castle]]

[[His castle]]


