:: Card Data {"position":"12900,200","size":"100,100"}
<!-- ========================================================= MASTER CARD LIBRARY This passage contains the permanent printed definitions of cards. These are templates, not the actual match copies. GENERIC EFFECT FIELDS battlecry: Runs when the creature is successfully played. deathrattle: Runs when the creature dies. turnStart: Runs at the start of its owner's turn. turnEnd: Runs at the end of its owner's turn. damagedTrigger: Runs after the creature takes damage and survives. friendlyDeathTrigger: Runs when another friendly creature dies. continuousEffect: An effect that remains active while this card is in play. keywords: Reusable rules and classifications. resetOnDeckReturn: When true, the card returns to its printed state when placed back into its owner's deck. The existing "effect" field remains during the transition so that currently working spell mechanics still function. ========================================================= -->
