:: Come with us. We can help you [Cave PanelLeft] {"position":"225,9000","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#d29d00)[Mara: I can’t stop imagining his face.]

She presses herself further into the wall, turning from you.

Her voice cracks.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Let me forget.]

Her hands begin to tremble. Nails biting into skin.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[For-get.]

She rakes her fingers through her hair.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[For-get.]

She grips her head with each repetition.

The word breaks apart in her mouth.

Fragments slip loose between sobs- names, places.

Then only shaking.

[[Please|Mara]]


