-existing-reply-heading">RESPONSE PREVIOUSLY TRANSMITTED: (print:_replyTone)</div><div class="office-email-existing-reply-text">(print:_replyText)</div></div>](else:)[<div class="office-email-reply-section"><div class="office-email-section-title">SELECT AUTHORISED RESPONSE</div><div class="office-email-reply-choice"><div class="office-email-reply-type">POSITIVE RESPONSE</div><div class="office-email-reply-preview">“(print:_positiveReply)”</div><div class="office-email-reply-button positive">(link:"TRANSMIT")[(set:$EmailReplies to $EmailReplies + (a:_positiveKey))(set:$LastEmailReplyText to _positiveReply)(set:$LastEmailReplyTone to "POSITIVE")(set:$LastEmailReplySubject to _subject)(goto:"Computer - Email Sent")]</div></div><div class="office-email-reply-choice"><div class="office-email-reply-type">NEUTRAL RESPONSE</div><div class="office-email-reply-preview">“(print:_neutralReply)”</div><div class="office-email-reply-button neutral">(link:"TRANSMIT")[(set:$EmailReplies to $EmailReplies + (a:_neutralKey))(set:$LastEmailReplyText to _neutralReply)(set:$LastEmailReplyTone to "NEUTRAL")(set:$LastEmailReplySubject to _subject)(goto:"Computer - Email Sent")]</div></div><div class="office-email-reply-choice"><div class="office-email-reply-type">NEGATIVE RESPONSE</div><div class="office-email-reply-preview">“(print:_negativeReply)”</div><div class="office-email-reply-button negative">(link:"TRANSMIT")[(set:$EmailReplies to $EmailReplies + (a:_negativeKey))(set:$LastEmailReplyText to _negativeReply)(set:$LastEmailReplyTone to "NEGATIVE")(set:$LastEmailReplySubject to _subject)(goto:"Computer - Email Sent")]</div></div></div>]</div>]</div><div class="office-computer-footer">OMEGA CORPORATION — COMMUNICATION IS A PRIVILEGE</div></div></div>


:: Conceal {"position":"4575,2375","size":"100,100"}
|rabbitSpeech>[(text-colour:#96d35f)[White Rabbit: Players are idiots... but this one's slightly more stubborn... and has particularly weak hips.


Whatever you do, don’t pick the second option.

That would be exactly what someone trying not to reveal 
themselves would do.
]
[[Option 1|op1]]

[[Option 2|op2]]]

<img class="rabbitSprite"
src="https://i.ibb.co/GLKysBx/Chat-GPT-Image-Feb-13-2026-at-02-02-37-PM.png">


:: Constipated {"position":"1075,500","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "It takes courage to talk about such an embarrassing ailment.

Well done.

You should increase water intake to 8–10 cups daily, consume fiber-rich foods. Fruits, vegetables, and oats, and try gentle exercise like walking to stimulate the bowels.

If this doesn't help in the short-term, then don't feel shy about asking for any more advice.


I hate to harp on, but you gotta get this blooming report done, buddy.
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
      [[Ok, I'll try some of these, thanks. I'll just do the report now...|That's actually really swell of you to say. Thanks. I guess I have you guys. I'm gonna do the report!]]
      
      [[I'm not doing your Google remedies, but I'll do the bloody report.|That's actually really swell of you to say. Thanks. I guess I have you guys. I'm gonna do the report!]]
      
      [[Look, this is more severe. I haven't pooped in months. I think I might be having a poop-baby or have some sort of parasitic creature living inside me that sustains itself on my poop.]]
      
      [[I'm still unsure... I'm going to write the suicide note out and see how I feel|This is for real. I'm going to write it out.]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


:: Consume Friendly Food {"position":"13300,100","size":"100,100"}
<!-- =========================================================
     UNIVERSAL FRIENDLY FOOD CONSUMPTION

     INPUTS

     $ConsumeSide
         "player" or "enemy"

     $ConsumeLane
         The lane containing the Food being consumed.

     $ConsumerLane
         The lane containing the consuming creature or Object.

         This may be 0 if no specific consumer is required.

     $ConsumerDefinitionID
         The definitionID of the creature or Object responsible
         for this consumption.

         Cooking Pot uses this to identify consumption performed
         specifically by itself.

     OUTPUTS

     $ConsumeSucceeded
         True when a valid friendly Food creature was consumed.

     $ConsumedFood
         The runtime card that was consumed.

     $ConsumedFoodValue
         The Food's current Health before consumption.

     $ConsumeMessage
         Text describing the consumption and triggered effects.

     RULES

     - Only friendly Food can be consumed.
     - Food value equals its current Health.
     - The Food-consumed total increases by Food value, not by 1.
     - Consumption activates the Food's Deathrattle.
     - Consumed Food returns to the bottom of its owner's deck.
     - Friendly Pearls trigger once per consumption event.
     - Pearl grants permanent maximum Mana beginning next turn.
     - Every living friendly Cooking Pot deals 1 damage whenever
       any friendly Food is consumed.
     ========================================================= -->

(set:$ConsumeSucceeded to false)

(set:$ConsumedFood to
	(dm:)
)

(set:$ConsumedFoodValue to 0)

(set:$ConsumeMessage to "")

(set:_consumeBoard to
	(a:)
)

(set:_consumeDeck to
	(a:)
)

(set:_validConsumeSide to false)

(set:_consumeDeathrattleMessage to "")


<!-- =========================================================
     LOAD THE CORRECT BOARD AND DECK
     ========================================================= -->

(if:$ConsumeSide is "player")[

	(set:_consumeBoard to
		$PlayerBoard
	)

	(set:_consumeDeck to
		$PlayerDeck
	)

	(set:_validConsumeSide to true)

]


(else-if:$ConsumeSide is "enemy")[

	(set:_consumeBoard to
		$EnemyBoard
	)

	(set:_consumeDeck to
		$EnemyDeck
	)

	(set:_validConsumeSide to true)

]


<!-- =========================================================
     VALIDATE THE REQUEST
     ========================================================= -->

(if:not _validConsumeSide)[

	(set:$ConsumeMessage to
		"No valid consumption side was supplied."
	)

]


(else-if:$ConsumeLane < 1 or $ConsumeLane > 3)[

	(set:$ConsumeMessage to
		"No valid Food lane was supplied."
	)

]


(else-if:(datanames:_consumeBoard's ($ConsumeLane))'s length is 0)[

	(set:$ConsumeMessage to
		"There was no creature to consume in that lane."
	)

]


(else:)[

	(set:_possibleFood to
		_consumeBoard's ($ConsumeLane)
	)


	(if:_possibleFood's "tribe" is not "Food")[

		(set:$ConsumeMessage to
			_possibleFood's "name" +
			" is not Food and could not be consumed."
		)

	]


	(else:)[

		<!-- =====================================================
		     RECORD THE FOOD BEFORE REMOVING IT
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:$ConsumedFood to
			_possibleFood
		)

		(set:$ConsumedFoodValue to
			(max:
				0,
				_possibleFood's "hp"
			)
		)

		(set:_consumedFoodName to
			_possibleFood's "name"
		)


		<!-- =====================================================
		     REMOVE THE FOOD FROM THE BOARD
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:_consumeBoard's ($ConsumeLane) to
			(dm:)
		)


		<!-- =====================================================
		     RESOLVE THE CONSUMED FOOD'S DEATHRATTLE
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:$TriggerCard to
			$ConsumedFood
		)

		(set:$TriggerSide to
			$ConsumeSide
		)

		(set:$TriggerLane to
			$ConsumeLane
		)

		(set:$TriggerMessage to "")

		(display:"Resolve Deathrattle")

		(set:_consumeDeathrattleMessage to
			$TriggerMessage
		)


		<!-- =====================================================
		     ADD THE FOOD'S CURRENT HP TO THE CONSUMED TOTAL
		     ===================================================== -->

		(if:$ConsumeSide is "player")[

			(set:$PlayerFoodConsumed to
				$PlayerFoodConsumed +
				$ConsumedFoodValue
			)

		]


		(else:)[

			(set:$EnemyFoodConsumed to
				$EnemyFoodConsumed +
				$ConsumedFoodValue
			)

		]


		<!-- =====================================================
		     TRIGGER FRIENDLY PEARLS

		     Pearl triggers once per consumption event, regardless
		     of the Food's value.
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:_pearlsTriggered to 0)


		(for:each _observerLane,...(range:1,3))[

			(if:(datanames:_consumeBoard's (_observerLane))'s length > 0)[

				(set:_observer to
					_consumeBoard's (_observerLane)
				)


				(if:
					_observer's "continuousEffect" is
					"gain-future-max-mana-when-friendly-food-consumed" and
					_observer's "hp" > 0
				)[

					(set:_pearlsTriggered to
						_pearlsTriggered + 1
					)

				]

			]

		]


		(if:_pearlsTriggered > 0)[

			(if:$ConsumeSide is "player")[

				(set:$PlayerPermanentManaBonus to
					$PlayerPermanentManaBonus +
					_pearlsTriggered
				)

			]


			(else:)[

				(set:$EnemyPermanentManaBonus to
					$EnemyPermanentManaBonus +
					_pearlsTriggered
				)

			]

		]


		<!-- =====================================================
		     TRIGGER FRIENDLY COOKING POTS

		     Every living friendly Cooking Pot deals exactly
		     1 damage whenever any friendly Food is consumed.

		     If the consuming card is itself a Cooking Pot, that Pot
		     may be temporarily absent from the board during the
		     observer scan, so it is counted separately.
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:_potsTriggered to 0)


		(for:each _observerLane,...(range:1,3))[

			(if:(datanames:_consumeBoard's (_observerLane))'s length > 0)[

				(set:_observer to
					_consumeBoard's (_observerLane)
				)


				(if:
					_observer's "continuousEffect" is
					"damage-enemy-when-friendly-food-consumed" and
					_observer's "hp" > 0
				)[

					(set:_potsTriggered to
						_potsTriggered + 1
					)

				]

			]

		]


		<!-- COUNT A CONSUMING COOKING POT THAT IS TEMPORARILY
		     ABSENT FROM THE BOARD -->

		(if:$ConsumerDefinitionID is "cooking-pot")[

			(set:_potsTriggered to
				_potsTriggered + 1
			)

		]


		(if:_potsTriggered > 0)[

			(if:$ConsumeSide is "player")[

				(set:$EnemyHP to
					(max:
						0,
						$EnemyHP -
						_potsTriggered
					)
				)

			]


			(else:)[

				(set:$PlayerHP to
					(max:
						0,
						$PlayerHP -
						_potsTriggered
					)
				)

			]

		]


		<!-- =====================================================
		     RESET ORDINARY FOOD BEFORE RETURNING TO THE DECK
		     ===================================================== -->

		(if:$ConsumedFood's "resetOnDeckReturn")[

			(set:_template to
				$CardData's
					($ConsumedFood's "definitionID")
			)

			(set:$ConsumedFood's "damage" to
				_template's "baseDamage"
			)

			(set:$ConsumedFood's "maxHP" to
				_template's "baseMaxHP"
			)

			(set:$ConsumedFood's "hp" to
				_template's "baseMaxHP"
			)

		]


		(else:)[

			(set:$ConsumedFood's "hp" to
				$ConsumedFood's "maxHP"
			)

		]


		(set:$ConsumedFood's "attackBonus" to 0)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "healthBonus" to 0)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "temporaryDamage" to 0)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "temporaryMaxHP" to 0)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "silenced" to false)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "poison" to 0)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "ready" to false)
		(set:$ConsumedFood's "canInitiateCombat" to false)


		<!-- =====================================================
		     RETURN THE FOOD TO THE BOTTOM OF ITS OWNER'S DECK
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:_consumeDeck to
			_consumeDeck +
			(a:$ConsumedFood)
		)


		(if:$ConsumeSide is "player")[

			(set:$PlayerBoard to
				_consumeBoard
			)

			(set:$PlayerDeck to
				_consumeDeck
			)

		]


		(else:)[

			(set:$EnemyBoard to
				_consumeBoard
			)

			(set:$EnemyDeck to
				_consumeDeck
			)

		]


		<!-- =====================================================
		     BUILD THE RESULT MESSAGE
		     ===================================================== -->

		(set:$ConsumeMessage to
			_consumedFoodName +
			" was consumed for " +
			(str:$ConsumedFoodValue) +
			" Food value. "
		)


		(if:_consumeDeathrattleMessage is not "")[

			(set:$ConsumeMessage to
				$ConsumeMessage +
				_consumeDeathrattleMessage
			)

		]


		(if:_pearlsTriggered is 1)[

			(set:$ConsumeMessage to
				$ConsumeMessage +
				"Pearl permanently granted 1 additional maximum Mana beginning next turn. "
			)

		]


		(else-if:_pearlsTriggered > 1)[

			(set:$ConsumeMessage to
				$ConsumeMessage +
				(str:_pearlsTriggered) +
				" Pearls each permanently granted 1 additional maximum Mana beginning next turn. "
			)

		]


		(if:_potsTriggered is 1)[

			(set:$ConsumeMessage to
				$ConsumeMessage +
				"Cooking Pot dealt 1 damage to the opposing hero. "
			)

		]


		(else-if:_potsTriggered > 1)[

			(set:$ConsumeMessage to
				$ConsumeMessage +
				(str:_potsTriggered) +
				" Cooking Pots each dealt 1 damage to the opposing hero. "
			)

		]


		(set:$ConsumeSucceeded to true)

	]

]



