:: Crush it in your hand [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"225,5225","size":"100,100"}
You crush it in your hand. It whimpers as blood gushes through your fingers...

Then...

You hear a human voice, eke out just enough breath to catch your ear.

The words are too quiet to make out, but they come from the other side of the egg you are standing beside.

(link: "Call out to the voice")[
	(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Call out to the voice")
]

(link: "Quietly approach the other side of the egg")[
	(set: $PERCEPTION100 to $PERCEPTION100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Quietly approach the other side of the egg")
]


:: Crush it under your foot [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"100,5100","size":"100,100"}
You leap forward and crush it under your heel. It stops moving.

Whatever it was is now a twisted mess of blood and viscera, but enough remains for you to see its nature. A small crab-like creature with a humans head.

Then...

You hear a human voice, eke out just enough breath to catch your ear.

The words are too quiet to make out, but they come from the other side of the egg you are standing beside.

(link: "Call out to the voice")[
	(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
