:: Draw Card {"position":"13600,0","size":"100,100"}
<!-- =========================================================
     UNIVERSAL CARD DRAW

     INPUT

     $DrawSide
         "player" or "enemy".

     OUTPUTS

     $DrawSucceeded
         True if the drawn card entered the hand.

     $DrawnCard
         The card that was drawn or cycled.

     $DrawMessage
         Text describing the result.

     HAND-LIMIT RULE

     Maximum hand size is 12.

     If the hand is full:
     - the top card is removed from the deck
     - it is placed at the bottom of the deck
     - the draw is wasted
     ========================================================= -->

(set:$DrawSucceeded to false)
(set:$DrawnCard to (dm:))
(set:$DrawMessage to "")

(set:_drawDeck to (a:))
(set:_drawHand to (a:))
(set:_validDrawSide to false)


<!-- =========================================================
     LOAD THE CORRECT DECK AND HAND
     ========================================================= -->

(if:$DrawSide is "player")[

	(set:_drawDeck to
		$PlayerDeck
	)

	(set:_drawHand to
		$PlayerHand
	)

	(set:_validDrawSide to true)

]


(else-if:$DrawSide is "enemy")[

	(set:_drawDeck to
		$EnemyDeck
	)

	(set:_drawHand to
		$EnemyHand
	)

	(set:_validDrawSide to true)

]


<!-- =========================================================
     VALIDATE THE DRAW
     ========================================================= -->

(if:not _validDrawSide)[

	(set:$DrawMessage to
		"No valid draw side was supplied."
	)

]


(else-if:_drawDeck's length is 0)[

	(if:$DrawSide is "player")[

		(set:$DrawMessage to
			"Your deck is empty."
		)

	]

	(else:)[

		(set:$DrawMessage to
			"The enemy deck is empty."
		)

	]

]


(else:)[

	(set:$DrawnCard to
		_drawDeck's 1st
	)


	<!-- =====================================================
	     REMOVE THE TOP CARD FROM THE DECK
	     ===================================================== -->

	(if:_drawDeck's length is 1)[

		(set:_drawDeck to
			(a:)
		)

	]

	(else:)[

		(set:_drawDeck to
			(subarray:_drawDeck,2,-1)
		)

	]


	<!-- =====================================================
	     HAND HAS SPACE
	     ===================================================== -->

	(if:_drawHand's length < 12)[

		(set:_drawHand to
			_drawHand +
			(a:$DrawnCard)
		)

		(set:$DrawSucceeded to true)

		(if:$DrawSide is "player")[

			(set:$DrawMessage to
				"You drew " +
				$DrawnCard's "name" +
				"."
			)

		]

		(else:)[

			(set:$DrawMessage to
				"The enemy drew a card."
			)

		]

	]


	<!-- =====================================================
	     HAND IS FULL

	     The card cycles to the bottom of the deck.
	     ===================================================== -->

	(else:)[

		(set:_drawDeck to
			_drawDeck +
			(a:$DrawnCard)
		)

		(if:$DrawSide is "player")[

			(set:$DrawMessage to
				"Your hand is full. " +
				$DrawnCard's "name" +
				" was moved to the bottom of your deck."
			)

		]

		(else:)[

			(set:$DrawMessage to
				"The enemy hand is full, so its drawn card was moved to the bottom of its deck."
			)

		]

	]


	<!-- =====================================================
	     SAVE THE UPDATED ZONES
	     ===================================================== -->

	(if:$DrawSide is "player")[

		(set:$PlayerDeck to
			_drawDeck
		)

		(set:$PlayerHand to
			_drawHand
		)

	]

	(else:)[

		(set:$EnemyDeck to
			_drawDeck
		)

		(set:$EnemyHand to
			_drawHand
		)

	]

]


:: Drop the ring into his hand [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"525,17150","size":"100,100"}
Guyh tumbles the ring between his fingers.

Then brings it to his lips.

His tongue unfurls.

Slow.

It traces the metal. Slips through the hollow. Presses into the grooves.

Testing every crevice.

He draws it back into his mouth.

Tastes.

His face tightens.

A low grumble.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: There's a word in here.]

He rolls the flavour across his tongue.

Searching.

He steps away.

Then stops.

Squats.

[[A word?|Well?]]


