available</div><div class="office-employee-label">CONTRACT TYPE</div><div class="office-employee-value">Permanent</div><div class="office-employee-label">LINE MANAGER</div><div class="office-employee-value">The Boss</div><div class="office-employee-label">SALARY BAND</div><div class="office-employee-value">Confidential Primate Compensation Arrangement</div><div class="office-employee-label">PERFORMANCE RATING</div><div class="office-employee-value"><span class="office-employee-rating">★★★★★</span> — HIGHEST RECORDED COMPANY RATING</div><div class="office-employee-label">ESTIMATED ANNUAL WORKLOAD COMPLETED</div><div class="office-employee-value">317%</div></div><div class="office-employee-section-title">REGISTERED SKILLS</div><div class="office-employee-skills"><span class="office-employee-skill">ADVANCED SPREADSHEET MANAGEMENT</span><span class="office-employee-skill">PROCESS OPTIMISATION</span><span class="office-employee-skill">HEAVY LIFTING</span><span class="office-employee-skill">TYPING — 84 WPM</span></div><div class="office-employee-section-title">EMPLOYEE SUMMARY</div><div class="office-employee-text">George was recruited as part of the Omega Infinite Workforce Initiative, an ambitious corporate programme based on the theory that an infinite number of monkeys, given sufficient time and office equipment, could complete any conceivable administrative task.<br><br>Twenty years after the initiative began, Omega Corporation has successfully employed one monkey.<br><br>Despite the programme currently operating at approximately one-infinity of its intended capacity, George has frequently been entrusted with high-priority workloads and complex administrative tasks. He has voluntarily covered the responsibilities of multiple departments during periods of staff absence.<br><br>Displays exceptional punctuality, concentration and professionalism.<br><br>Has never submitted a sick day.</div><div class="office-employee-section-title">MANAGEMENT NOTES</div><div class="office-employee-text">Exceptional employee.<br><br>Frequently observed completing tasks assigned to other members of staff.<br><br>Employees should be discouraged from referring to George as “the monkey.” His legal first name is George.<br><br>Continues to decline promotion opportunities.<br><br>Has requested a larger keyboard on twelve separate occasions. Request remains under review.</div><div class="office-employee-section-title">DISCIPLINARY RECORD</div><div class="office-employee-text"><strong>15/03/20XX</strong><br>Employee climbed the archive shelving to retrieve incorrectly filed documents.<br><br><strong>Action Taken:</strong> None. Documents successfully recovered.<br><br><strong>04/08/20XX</strong><br>Employee removed Stanley from the office ceiling.<br><br><strong>Action Taken:</strong> Commended.</div><div class="office-employee-warning">NOTICE: George currently holds the highest performance rating of any employee within Omega Corporation. Management requests that this information not be shared with the human workforce.</div></div></div><div class="office-computer-menu office-database-return">(link-goto:"RETURN TO EMPLOYEE DIRECTORY","Office Computer - Employee Profile")(link-goto:"RETURN TO TERMINAL","Office - Computer")</div></div><div class="office-computer-footer">OMEGA CORPORATION — PERSONNEL RECORD OMG-00001</div></div></div>


