:: Get out my computer, or I'll throw it out the window! {"position":"4700,1500","size":"100,100"}
|rabbitSpeech>[(text-colour:#96d35f)[White Rabbit: Please don't do that. 

I'm a ghost in the machine. In your machine for now. 
All that will do is destroy your computer and leave you 
forever trapped in your cycle of misery.

I want to help you, and you'll just have to trust me.]

No, don't trust him! He hacked your computer!

[[I'll trust the narrator, thanks though]]

[[Okay, I'll trust you]]

[[Why would I trust you? Look at you... you look 
untrustworthy, you're wearing a mask]]

[[Continue, Mr Rabbit- 
Covertly press the the red button under your desk, 
signalling to the IT department you've been hacked|Okay, I'll trust you]]
]

<img class="rabbitSprite"
src="https://i.ibb.co/GLKysBx/Chat-GPT-Image-Feb-13-2026-at-02-02-37-PM.png">


:: Give him the ring [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"425,17150","size":"100,100"}
Guyh tumbles the ring between his fingers.

Then brings it to his lips.

His tongue unfurls.

Slow.

It traces the metal. Slips through the hollow. Presses into the grooves.

Testing every crevice.

He draws it back into his mouth.

Tastes.

His face tightens.

A low grumble.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: There's a word in here.]

He rolls the flavour across his tongue.

Searching.

He steps away.

Then stops.

Squats.

[[A word?|Well?]]


