:: Give me the club, Koemi [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"200,13275","size":"100,100"}
Koemi is already in motion.

The club passes your shoulder.

It strikes.

Splinters spit from the metal like sparks.

Thunder rings through the chamber.

Again.

Again.

Each blow weaker than the last.

The door does not care how hard it is struck.

Her breath begins to shake.

The final strike lands without conviction.

She lowers the club.

Then slides down the wall and disappears into herself.

A tear cuts a clean line through the grime on her cheek.

She turns her face from you.

[[We rest. Then double back]]

[[Sit down beside her]]


