:: Go back {"position":"300,12350","size":"100,100"}
(align:"=><=")[You twist in the dark.

The tunnel is tighter than you remember.

Your shoulder wedges against stone.

You force yourself free-

But the turn costs you.

The passage narrows.

The water presses in.

Your lungs convulse.

You claw for space.

There is none.

Your chest floods.

The world fractures.

Your eyes open into sensation- burning, not sight.

Then nothing.

(link: "...")[
		(set: $HP to 1)
		(go-to: "goback2")
	]
    ]


:: Go back and get them [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"175,12650","size":"100,100"}
Your body begs you not to return to the water.

But your resolve denies it.

Now at least, doubt will not bite.

You guide them through.

[[...|gbagt]]


:: Go back and help pull them out [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"350,6000","size":"100,100"}
You turn back.

You tear at the shell, widening the fracture.

You grab his hand.

He spills free into your arms, choking on air.

You haul him upright.

His arm hooks over your shoulder.

You run.

The embankment rises ahead.

You collapse onto it together as the wave crashes behind you, its spray hissing across 
both your backs.

All you can do now is breathe.

[[Breathe|Breath]]


