:: Hang yourself {"position":"3150,5125","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "...

It has survived meetings.

It has endured coffee stains.

It has witnessed performance reviews.

Today, your tie, was promoted. Not you.


For you...

A final release.

Two, in fact.


The last spark of you fades away...


And you shit yourself violently.



The world does not go dark in a grand, operatic way.

It merely sighs.

Like an office printer finally giving up.
")

