:: Hold your composure and step througharmed [PanelLeft Gate] {"position":"300,11600","size":"100,100"}
You press yourself through the bars.

You step forward as though you have every right to.

The creature waits in the dark.

Drenched in shadow, it draws back.

Then you hear it speak.

Its voice. 

Deep. 

Unnatural.

But beneath the twisted growls, you catch it- a woman’s voice.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: You… walk…]

It recoils further.

Not in fear.

(text-colour:red)[… like… him.]

The creature sniffs. 

A wretched gust cuts past you.

The shadows shift.

It moves-  not away.

Toward something else.

Koemi waits a moment longer, then steps through.

Rey follows. 
(set: $LIKEHIM to true)
[[...|Hycast]]


