:: I want to help you, Koemi. But not him [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"175,7400","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: I am growing impatient.]

He rocks his head from side to side like a fussy child.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You would not be able to even talk with her if it weren't for me.]

He smiles.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Do not pout, Koemi. Stick out your tongue.]

He unravels his own long black tongue. On it, you can just discern a glyph- imprinted like a brand.

Koemi bites her tongue inside her mouth.

Guyh prods her with his gaze.

Reluctantly, she unfurls it.

She too bears the mark.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[A seal of understanding.]

His eyes slide to you.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I gave to her freely. And to you too I will give.]

He extends his arms, palm up.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[But that is not all I offer.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[That is a handshake.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I offer you.]

He savours the word.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Hope.]

(link: "Your tongue matches your words")[
	(set: $PERCEPTION100 to $PERCEPTION100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We don’t need your hope")
]

