:: I'm unsure if I can keep living like this {"position":"1400,250","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Hope is always hiding around the corner.

You hear that?

I can hear it, it's Hope. It's giggling. It's hiding around the corner and it thinks you don't know it's there.


You just gotta have faith. In yourself.


You don't need to be an unhappy chappy.

Think about it.

After you've done your work, you'll be so close to getting that promotion. 

The one you've always wanted.
")

(if: $SANE is true)[Sanity comes with hope...]

(if: $PEN is true)[I know we'll find your lost pen together

]
|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
      [[You know what, fuck this. Fuck the note, fuck the report. I'm going all the way!|I have nothing to live for. You're not going to talk me out of this]]
      
      [[Even if I found hope around the corner. I'd just keep walking past.|This is for real. I'm going to write it out.]]
      
      [[True, I'll trust you. I want that promotion so bad. It'll fix everything.|EarningReport]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


