:: If I do this, Koemi, anything that happens is on you [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"100,8000","size":"100,100"}
Koemi nods.

Guyh smirks and wraps his hands around his stomach.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: By the belchers belly.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[A fellowship has bloomed.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Now. 

Go fetch the other two, Koemi.]

A faint smile.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Time goes only forward.]

She draws in a slow breath.

Then steps inside.

The cave swallows her.


Guyh gestures toward Dan’s mouth with crooked fingers.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Give me your tongue.]

Dan half-closes his eyes and sticks it out.

Guyh’s voice changes.

He utters a few quiet words and pricks Dan’s tongue with his fingernail.

Dan yelps and recoils, grabbing at his mouth.

He presses his cheeks tight, waiting for the pain.

It fades. Like a shifting breeze.

He spits a thread of blood onto the sand.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I can feel it.]

He licks his teeth.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[On my tongue.]

(link: "Do it")[
    (set: $HP to $HP - 1)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Do it")
]


