:: Inspect the area [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"300,5000","size":"100,100"}
You let the sound leave you. The air carries it away.

You spot something small, moving amongst the shards of bone in the shadow of a nearby egg. 

(link: "Grab it quickly before it escapes")[
	(set: $INSTINCT100 to $INSTINCT100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")

	(set: $RollTotal to (random: 1, 6) + (random: 1, 6) + $INSTINCT)

	(if: $RollTotal >= 7)[
		(go-to: "Grab it quickly before it escapes")
	](else:)[
		(go-to: "Grab it quickly before it escapesfail")
	]
]

(link: "Watch it carefully")[
	(set: $PERCEPTION100 to $PERCEPTION100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")

	(set: $RollTotal to (random: 1, 6) + (random: 1, 6) + $PERCEPTION)

	(if: $RollTotal >= 7)[
		(go-to: "Watch it carefully")
	](else:)[
		(go-to: "Watch it carefullyfail")
	]
]

(link: "Crush it under your foot")[
	(set: $FORCE100 to $FORCE100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")

	(set: $RollTotal to (random: 1, 6) + (random: 1, 6) + $FORCE)

	(if: $RollTotal >= 7)[
		(go-to: "Crush it under your foot")
	](else:)[
		(set: $HP to $HP - 1)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
		(go-to: "Crush it under your footfail")
	]
]


