teractionPopupText to "The mouse hole is empty. All that remains is dust, rat hair, and several unpaid invoices.")](else:)[(set:$InteractionPopupText to "The Office Rat lies motionless beside the mouse hole. Peering into the darkness, you notice the faint glimmer of several Golden Stars hidden just inside.")](rerun:?interactionPopup)]</div>](else-if:$InteractionView is "briefcase")[<div class="mousehole-popup-note"><div class="mousehole-note-heading">To whom it may concern,</div><p>After thirty-seven years of loyal service, management has once again denied my promotion to Senior Rat.</p><p>They said I lack “leadership presence” and “basic hygiene.” Meanwhile, Darren gets promoted despite being literally braindead after his skiiing accident.</p><p>I have given everything to this company. My youth. My health. Three litters of children I barely know.</p><p>Please tell Payroll that they still owe me twelve minutes of overtime.</p><div class="mousehole-note-signature">Regards,<br>Reginald S. Rat<br><span>Assistant to the Regional Mouse</span></div></div><div class="mousehole-popup-options">(link:"Back")[(set:$InteractionView to "main")(if:$OfficeRatStarsTaken and $OfficeRatBriefcaseSearched)[(set:$InteractionPopupText to "The mouse hole is empty. All that remains is dust, rat hair, and several unpaid invoices.")](else:)[(set:$InteractionPopupText to "The Office Rat lies motionless beside the mouse hole. Peering into the darkness, you notice the faint glimmer of several Golden Stars hidden just inside.")](rerun:?interactionPopup)]</div>]](else:)[<div class="mousehole-popup-options">(link:"Talk to him")[(go-to:"Office Rat Conversation")](link:"Leave")[(set:$InteractionPopupOpen to false)(set:$InteractionView to "main")(set:$InteractionID to "")(rerun:?interactionPopup)]</div>]<div class="mousehole-popup-close">(link:"Close")[(set:$InteractionPopupOpen to false)(set:$InteractionView to "main")(set:$InteractionID to "")(rerun:?interactionPopup)]</div></div></div>](else-if:$I