:: Intern #042- Bradley K {"position":"6625,1700","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Ah, Bradley.

Safe choice.

You don't want to bite off more than you can chew.

I'm sure he'll be delighted to hear his hips are being surgically removed in support of departmental objectives.
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
      [[Right. So when do I get the hips?]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


