:: It might have purpose [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1375,12250","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s gaze lingers on your hand.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: That purpose will be your death. Why risk it?]

Rey lowers his chin slightly. His eyes do not leave yours.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Risk your own life if you must. Not ours.]

He steps closer. Not enough to touch you. Enough.

[[It's just a ring]]

[[I hear you. That’s close enough|I hear you clearly. No need to step forward ]]

[[It's hardly a risk. Don't threaten me, Rey]]

[[I understand- put it back]]


:: It must mean something else [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"100,16150","size":"100,100"}
Guyh swallows whatever he was about to say.

A faint smile.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: You’re hungry.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[So am I.]

He squares himself to you.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[When we bring the sister back, I’ll answer your questions.]

A pause.

He lifts one finger.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Or.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Perhaps I’ll give you my blade.]

Rey shifts his weight.

Guyh sheaths his finger.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[When we get her back, you may have your answers. As many as you can eat.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Or you may have my blade.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Choose.]

[[Answers]]

[[The blade]]

[[Neither]]


