:: It's hardly a risk. Don't threaten me, Rey [Nobeast PanelLeft] {"position":"1500,12375","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:lime)[Rey: I’m not threatening you.]

Pause.

(text-colour:lime)[I’m reminding you.]

Rey’s stance shifts.

He no longer faces you squarely- repositioning just enough to narrow your angle to the water.

The water trembles.

It is no longer in the tunnels.

Rey’s eyes widen.

Koemi freezes.

You cannot help but tense.

It is in the chamber.

[[...|BEAST]]


:: It's just a ring [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1400,12375","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s gaze hardens.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Nothing is “just” anything down here.]

Rey stops.

His stance shifts, just enough to narrow your angle to the water.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Now it’s just a ring?!]

Only after her voice rises do you realise how quiet it has become.

Then-

The water trembles.

It is no longer in the tunnels.

Rey’s eyes widen.

Koemi freezes.

You cannot help but tense.

It is in the chamber.

[[...|BEAST]]


