:: I’ll do it. You two being strong gives us the best chance of rescuing Koemi’s sister [Glyphs PanelLeft] {"position":"325,17450","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s eyebrows lift- almost sincere.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: I knew you’d make the right call.]

He folds his arms, nodding once.

(text-colour:lime)[We’re a team. We each have our moments.]

A slight pause.

(text-colour:lime)[This was yours.]

Dan rolls onto his side.

Grunts, forcing his muscles into motion.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I’ve got blood to give.]

(text-colour:lime)[Lie back down, Dan.

If you lose a drop more, you’ll die.]

Dan looks to Koemi.

She nods.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: So eager to sacrifice yourself.

It’ll lose its taste.]

Dan lingers on Guyh’s words, groans, and rolls onto his back.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I want a cup of tea.]

He rubs his face with his palms.

[[Koemi?]]

[[We'll get a cup of tea soon, Dan]]


