(if: $FIRSTFAIL is true) [Ok, this is your first time failing a roll.

I'll be kind. 

I'm going to give you a coin... no, actually...

A talisman.

It's very powerful. Supernatural in nature. It was passed down between generations of occult scions, and eventually ended up in my hands.

You can use this talismans power only once, and if you do I'll give you a chance to roll the dice again...

But, if you do. A kitten will die.

