						"speaker","player",
						"text","So where am I supposed to get one?"
					),
					(dm:
						"speaker","npc",
						"text","I discarded one this morning."
					),
					(dm:
						"speaker","npc",
						"text","A wretched collection."
					),
					(dm:
						"speaker","npc",
						"text","Fit only for slimeling babies still soft beneath the cap."
