:: Lead the way, Guye [PanelLeft Eyes] {"position":"100,10425","size":"100,100"}
Guyh bows his head and clambers into the mouth.

Koemi follows.

Dan hesitates. Nervous. He gestures politely, letting you go first.

Rey lingers, almost content to do so.

Dan’s hand settles briefly on your shoulder, and together you let the light of the world fade behind you.

Into nothing.

Droplets strike the slow-moving filth at your feet, each impact a quiet note in the dark.

The silence presses.

The dark feels absolute.

Guyh turns and whispers, his eyes glowing faintly in the abyss.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Silence can be rude if disturbed.]

He turns back around, his bulging eyes vanishing into nothing.

[[...|theabyss]]


:: Leave [LeaveDan] {"position":"25,11275","size":"100,100"}
(align:"=><=")[You leave with them.

Disappearing around a bend.

The torchlight narrows.

Dan closes his eyes before the dark takes it from him.

Silence.

[[...|wcb2]]]


:: Leave and let her fade away on her own [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"400,5475","size":"100,100"}
You turn to leave, and stop.

A young woman stands directly in your path.

Her eyes flick past you, briefly, toward the dying woman behind. Then they return to yours and stay there, searching, as if trying to understand something you haven’t said.

[[...|Untitled Passage4]]


:: Leave the chamber [PanelLeft] {"position":"1700,12000","size":"100,100"}
You leave.

The chamber vanishes behind a shallow bend.

The smell of death follows you, urging you onward.

The grumbling rises- almost a cry.

You move further from it.

For now.

The grumbling does not fade.

It follows.

The passage splits in two.

Familiar markings etched into the stone.

[[Three diagonal scratches|diagonal]]

(if: $VERTICAL is false)[ [[Three vertical gouges|vertical]] ]


:: Leave your dagger beside her [PanelLeft Cave] {"position":"475,9200","size":"100,100"}
You set your dagger down gently at her feet.

She clenches her toes.

And at last, she lifts her head.

Her face is swallowed by shadow.

She looks at you.

Then lowers it again.

You leave.

[[...|outsidenodagger]]


