:: Let it bite your hand [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"400,5225","size":"100,100"}
It bites into your hand and draws blood. It's eyes roll back as you feel the warmth leaving your hand. It has no intention of stopping. You put it down and feel calm from your mercy.

A moment later you hear a human voice, eke out just enough breath to catch your ear.

The words are too quiet to make out, but they come from the other side of the egg you are standing beside.

