:: Light the torch [PanelLeft] {"position":"0,10625","size":"100,100"}
Koemi rummages through her satchel.

She strikes the flint.

Each spark snaps outward, its echo splintering into the labyrinth.

Light flashes- sharp, percussive.

Stone answers with hollow clacks.

Then.

The flame answers.

[[...|ltt]]


