:: Look [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"175,16825","size":"100,100"}
Your eyes search him over.

His skin is mapped in glyphs.

Carved.

Ink pressed into old scars.

But you notice something else.

Across his chest.

Where his heart should be-

A long, careful incision.

Stitched closed.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Somewhere on me is the mark that answers this door.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Unfortunately… I cannot see all of me.]

(if: $RING is true)[ [[I have the key. But the door won't open]] ](else:)[ [[Step forward]]

[[Let someone else move first]] ]


