:: Lost my favourite pen somewhere around the water cooler last month {"position":"550,725","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "My God. 

You've really lost nothing more important than your pen!?

Pull yourself together, Goddamnit!


Look, I get it, it was a good pen. The ink didn't blotch and the nib was somehow smooth on both matte and gloss paper, irregardless of grammage. 

But...

You've become a zombie, but with less aspirations and dreams. They at least want to eat brains...

I'm starting to give up on you.


You must still have some hope... a dream? something you want?

")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

