:: Lost my sanity {"position":"400,725","size":"100,100"}
(set: $SANE to true)
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "I think so too.

You've been staring at your computer screen for over an hour now.


Earlier, I actually thought you might have died...

My heart was in my throat!

Then you blinked.

Thank God.


After you've done your work, we'll brainstorm how to get your sanity back. We'll set up an Excel, we'll KPI your sanity, and benchmark your sanity against other employees. While you're working I'll start ideation for a flowchart. Once I've done that I'll send you a calendar invite.
")

