:: Mara [Cave PanelLeft] {"position":"225,9100","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#d29d00)[Mara: Stop.]

Her voice is sharper now.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Stop trying to pull me.]

She presses herself harder into the stone.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Just go.]

A tremor passes through her.

Her voice rises- but only for a breath.

It falters before it can become a scream.

She swallows it.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Let me be nothing.]

A breath.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Let me be.]

You understand.

She has chosen.

[[Leave|LeaveM]]

[[Leave your dagger beside her|DaggerM]]


