:: NEXT [PanelLeft Rey] {"position":"100,8600","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: Well. Hard to smile through that.]

Dan rubs the back of his neck.

Rey turns fully toward him.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: That was… quite unpleasant.]

He dabs at the blood at the corner of his mouth.

(text-colour:lime)[But I’m relieved it gave you something to smile about.]

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I… I didn’t mean—]

(text-colour:lime)[No.]

A small pause.

(text-colour:lime)[Of course you didn’t.]

He holds Dan’s gaze just a moment too long.

(link: "And what of the woman, in the cave?")[
	(set: $HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "And what of the woman, in the cave?")
]

(link: "So. What's the plan then?")[
	(set: $FORCE100 to $FORCE100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We can't leave hur")
]

(link: "Perhaps language was not a blessing...")[
	(set: $INTELLECT100 to $INTELLECT100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Perhaps language was not a blessing...")
]
(if: $HUDPortraits is not an array)[(set: $HUDPortraits to (a:))]
(set: $HUDPortraits to $HUDPortraits + (a:"https://i.ibb.co/jZ4Zf0Zw/lime-border-portrait.png"))


:: NEXT0 [PanelLeft Rey] {"position":"100,8500","size":"100,100"}
Guyh does not answer.

He simply watches him.

Rey’s smile lingers.

A moment passes.

Then another.

No one else speaks.

The silence stretches.

Rey keeps smiling.

The corners begin to stiffen.

Guyh tilts his head- barely.

Still nothing.

Rey’s smile falters.

Just a fraction.

That is when Guyh moves.

His hand closes around Rey’s jaw with quiet precision, thumb steady beneath the chin.

A finger presses lightly against the tongue.

Not hard.

Just enough.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: You have not earned the skip in your step.]

His voice remains level.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Keep your smiles for yourself.]

He releases him.

As though nothing occurred.

Rey swallows once.

Winces- barely.

Then spits blood onto the ground.

His smile returns.

Thinner.

[[...|NEXT]]


