:: No actually. This doesn't sit right with me {"position":"6400,1250","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "I'm devastated.

Really.

I had my hopes up... but I suppose this is a learning moment for me. 

Going forward, I will be more cautious about placing my trust in individuals demonstrating significant hip-related performance limitations.


I'll have to live with your weak hips. 

It's going to be difficult, but with determination and true grit, I'm sure I can overcome this.


So... okay. Let's have a look at the alternatives...

Strong hips are included in the company make-a-wish policy by default.

Paper planes, paper boats, and origami swans are also available as substitutes...


Wait a second...

I'm just going through the policy now...

Ah.

It seems there's a clause I had overlooked.
")

