(set:$CaptainDialogueIndex to 1)(if:$CaptainProductivityDefeated)[(if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits is 0)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Captain Productivity? That's you now. I'm just Barry from Accounts."))](else-if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits is 1)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"The Chosen God of Productivity has returned! The office salutes you!"))](else-if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits is 2)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Why are you still coming to me? You're the Captain now. Please let me sulk in glorious unproductivity."))](else-if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits is 3)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"I've started taking two-hour lunch breaks. It's wonderful. I finally understand what happiness is."))](else-if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits is 4)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"I haven't completed a single spreadsheet all week. I've never felt so free."))](else:)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"The office salutes you! Keep up the good work!"))]](else:)[(if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 0)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Go do something productive!"))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 1)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Didn't you hear me? Go do something productive!"))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 2)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Do you know what the word 'productive' means?"))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 3)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"You're a little slow, aren't you? Fine... BE. PRODUCTIVE."))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 4)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"For the love of quarterly profits, please just leave me alone."))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 5)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Look... productivity dysfunction is nothing to be ashamed of. Just stop making it my problem."))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 6)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"I ought to staple you to a performance review, you unproductive swine!"))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 7)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"That is your final warning. Speak to me again and there will be consequences."))](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits is 8)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"One. More. Click. I dare you."))](else:)[(set:$CaptainDialogueLines to (a:"Very well... Prepare to experience the Fist of Productivity!"))]]<div class="room-screen captain-bg"><div class="captain-speech-bubble"><div class="captain-speech-text">|captainSpeech>[(print:$CaptainDialogueLines's ($CaptainDialogueIndex))]</div>|captainPrompt>[]</div><div class="captain-advance-area">|captainAdvance>[Continue]</div></div>(click-rerun:?captainAdvance)[(if:$CaptainDialogueIndex < $CaptainDialogueLines's length)[(set:$CaptainDialogueIndex to $CaptainDialogueIndex + 1)(rerun:?captainSpeech)](else:)[(if:$CaptainProductivityDefeated)[(if:$CaptainPostBattleVisits < 5)[(set:$CaptainPostBattleVisits to $CaptainPostBattleVisits + 1)](go-to:"Your Office")](else-if:$CaptainOfficeVisits < 9)[(set:$CaptainOfficeVisits to $CaptainOfficeVisits + 1)(go-to:"Your Office")](else:)[(go-to:"Captain Productivity Battle")]]]


