:: Office Rat Aftermath {"position":"8000,5900","size":"100,100"}
(set:$OfficeRatDefeated to true)

The rat lies dead beside the mouse hole.

The path ahead is free.

|ratAftermath>[
(if:not $MouseHoleSearched)[
	(link:"Reach inside the mouse hole")[
		(set:$MouseHoleSearched to true)

		(if:($InvSlot1 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot1 is not "") and ($InvSlot2 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot2 is not "") and ($InvSlot3 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot3 is not "") and ($InvSlot4 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot4 is not "") and ($InvSlot5 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot5 is not "") and ($InvSlot6 is not "Empty" and $InvSlot6 is not ""))[
			(replace:?ratAftermath)[
				You reluctantly push your hand into the mouse hole.

				Your fingers brush against something soft, greasy, and worryingly warm.

				You find a wedge of cheese, but your inventory is full.

				Beneath it is a tiny folded note, written in shaky handwriting.

				(link:"Read the note")[
					(replace:?ratAftermath)[
						The note reads:

						''To whom it may concern,''

						''After thirty-seven years of loyal service, management has once again denied my promotion to Senior Rat.''

						''They said I lack “leadership presence” and “basic hygiene.” Meanwhile, Darren gets promoted just because his uncle owns the building.''

						''I have given everything to this company. My youth. My health. Three litters of children I barely know.''

						''Please tell Payroll that they still owe me twelve minutes of overtime.''

						''Regards,''

						''Reginald S. Rat''

						''Assistant to the Regional Mouse''

						<br><br>

						(link-goto:"Leave the mouse hole","Your Office")
					]
				]

				<br><br>

				(link-goto:"Leave the mouse hole","Your Office")
			]
		]
		(else:)[
			(if:$InvSlot1 is "Empty" or $InvSlot1 is "")[
				(set:$InvSlot1 to "Cheese")
			]
			(else-if:$InvSlot2 is "Empty" or $InvSlot2 is "")[
				(set:$InvSlot2 to "Cheese")
			]
			(else-if:$InvSlot3 is "Empty" or $InvSlot3 is "")[
				(set:$InvSlot3 to "Cheese")
			]
			(else-if:$InvSlot4 is "Empty" or $InvSlot4 is "")[
				(set:$InvSlot4 to "Cheese")
			]
			(else-if:$InvSlot5 is "Empty" or $InvSlot5 is "")[
				(set:$InvSlot5 to "Cheese")
			]
			(else:)[
				(set:$InvSlot6 to "Cheese")
			]

			(rerun:?MAPUI)

			(replace:?ratAftermath)[
				You reluctantly push your hand into the mouse hole.

				Your fingers brush against something soft, greasy, and worryingly warm.

				You find a wedge of '''Cheese'''.

				''Cheese added to inventory.''

				Beneath it is a tiny folded note, written in shaky handwriting.

				(link:"Read the note")[
					(replace:?ratAftermath)[
						The note reads:

						''To whom it may concern,''

						''After thirty-seven years of loyal service, management has once again denied my promotion to Senior Rat.''

						''They said I lack “leadership presence” and “basic hygiene.” Meanwhile, Darren gets promoted just because his uncle owns the building.''

						''I have given everything to this company. My youth. My health. Three litters of children I barely know.''

						''Please tell Payroll that they still owe me twelve minutes of overtime.''

						''Regards,''

						''Reginald S. Rat''

						''Assistant to the Regional Mouse''

						<br><br>

						(link-goto:"Leave the mouse hole","Your Office")
					]
				]

				<br><br>

				(link-goto:"Leave the mouse hole","Your Office")
			]
		]
	]
]
(else:)[
	You have already searched the mouse hole.

	All that remains inside is dust, rat hair, and several unpaid invoices.
]

<br><br>

(link-goto:"Continue","Your Office")
]


:: Office Rat Conversation {"position":"5000,4500","size":"100,100"}
(set:$DialogueStage to "start")
(if:$OfficeRatState is "refused")[(set:$ActiveDialogue to $OfficeRatRefusedDialogue)](else-if:$OfficeRatState is "accepted")[(set:$OfficeRatVisitCount to $OfficeRatVisitCount + 1)(if:$OfficeRatVisitCount is 1)[(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue's openingEvents to (a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat cautiously emerges from the mouse hole, still clutching his battered briefcase."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Any luck?")))](else-if:$OfficeRatVisitCount is 2)[(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue's openingEvents to (a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat pokes his head out and glances hopefully past you."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Any luck?")))](else-if:$OfficeRatVisitCount is 3)[(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue's openingEvents to (a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat emerges and anxiously adjusts his tiny tie."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Have you... sharpened your weapon at least?")))](else-if:$OfficeRatVisitCount is 4)[(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue's openingEvents to (a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat leans against the edge of the mouse hole, looking increasingly doubtful."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Have you at least looked in the general direction of the kitchen?")))](else:)[(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue's openingEvents to (a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat emerges with the tired expression of somebody attending a meeting that should have been an email."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","I'm beginning to suspect you've forgotten.")))](set:$ActiveDialogue to $OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue)](else-if:$OfficeRatState is "bossKilled")[(set:$ActiveDialogue to $OfficeRatBossKilledDialogue)](else-if:$OfficeRatState is "rewardCollected")[(set:$ActiveDialogue to $OfficeRatRewardCollectedDialogue)](else:)[(set:$ActiveDialogue to $OfficeRatDialogue)](display:"Conversation UI")


:: Office Rat Conversation Data [startup] {"position":"4800,5000","size":"100,100"}
(set:$OfficeRatDialogue to (dm:"npcName","Office Rat","playerName","You","playerPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/zH6zBCBq/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-03-39.png","npcPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/JDwtXg9/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-00-06.png","background","https://i.ibb.co/mrDs3wBb/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-22-2026-at-06-05-48-PM.png","exitPassage","Your Office","openingEvents",(a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","A tiny office rat wearing an oversized shirt and tie cautiously emerges from the darkness beneath a filing cabinet. Tucked beneath one arm is a battered leather briefcase. In the other paw, he clutches the block of cheese, taking nervous little bites between glances over his shoulder.")),"stages",(a:(dm:"id","start","choices",(a:(dm:"label","You have clothes?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","You have clothes?"),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat instinctively straightens his tiny tie and clutches the briefcase a little tighter."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Provided by the company.")),"next","employee"))),(dm:"id","employee","choices",(a:(dm:"label","You're an employee?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","You're an employee?"),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","I guess so, yeah. Haven't had a performance review for years now...")),"next","briefcase"))),(dm:"id","briefcase","choices",(a:(dm:"label","What's in the briefcase?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","What's in the briefcase?"),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Documents, crumbs... and my suicide note.")),"next","suicide"))),(dm:"id","suicide","choices",(a:(dm:"label","You want to kill yourself?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","You want to kill yourself?"),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat absent-mindedly rubs a thumb across a folded piece of paper poking from inside the briefcase."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Yeah... I do. Or... I might. I just don't feel like I'm being utilised by the company anymore. I've been passed over for promotion more times than I can count... but honestly, what's hurting me the most is love. I'm just really lonely.")),"next","support"))),(dm:"id","support","choices",(a:(dm:"label","We're basically the same person.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","We're basically the same person."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat studies you for several uncomfortable seconds."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Well... welcome to the club."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat sighs and takes another bite of his cheese."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","My boss is such a jackass. God, I hate him.")),"next","playerBoss"),(dm:"label","Don't give up, buddy. There's always hope.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Don't give up, buddy. There's always hope."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat forces a smile that doesn't quite reach his eyes."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Thanks..."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat sighs and takes another bite of his cheese."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","My boss is such a jackass. God, I hate him.")),"next","playerBoss"))),(dm:"id","playerBoss","choices",(a:(dm:"label","Yeah, my boss sucks too. I'm going to fight him and take my promotion by force.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Yeah, my boss sucks too. I'm going to fight him and take my promotion by force."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat brushes a few cheese crumbs from his whiskers."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Oh! Wow... you're not nearly as pathetic as you look. Hey, do you think you could murder my boss?")),"next","differentBoss"))),(dm:"id","differentBoss","choices",(a:(dm:"label","We don't have the same boss?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","We don't have the same boss?"),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","No, of course not. My boss is a rat. His office is hidden inside a crevice behind the kitchen cupboards.")),"next","murderChoice"))),(dm:"id","murderChoice","choices",(a:(dm:"label","What's in it for me? I already gave you a block of cheese.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","What's in it for me? I already gave you a block of cheese."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","I've got a few Golden Stars stashed back there. You kill him... they're yours.")),"next","rewardChoice"),(dm:"label","Sure. I'll do it. Friends?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Sure. I'll do it. Friends?"),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat's ears perk up, and a genuine smile creeps across the edges of his mouth. He offers you his tiny paw, and you shake it."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Friends. Good luck."),(dm:"speaker","player","text","Thanks. Don't kill yourself before I get back."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","...I'll try.")),"setOfficeRatState","accepted","next","end"),(dm:"label","No. I'm not committing murder twice. Once was more than enough.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","No. I'm not committing murder twice. Once is more than enough."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat lowers his head. For a long moment, neither of you says anything."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","I understand... thanks for the cheese anyway."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","Clutching his briefcase to his chest, the little rat disappears back into the darkness beneath the office.")),"setOfficeRatState","refused","next","end"))),(dm:"id","rewardChoice","choices",(a:(dm:"label","Why don't I just reach in and take them?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Why don't I just reach in and take them? I could probably get my arm in there."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","I'd like to see you try, jackass! I'll chew your bloody nose off!")),"next","threatChoice"),(dm:"label","Okay. Deal.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Okay. Deal."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat hesitates before offering one tiny paw. You shake it."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","You're not so bad. Good luck.")),"setOfficeRatState","accepted","next","end"))),(dm:"id","threatChoice","choices",(a:(dm:"label","Let's go, punk.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Let's go, punk.")),"setOfficeRatState","dead","destination","Start Office Rat Battle","next","end"),(dm:"label","Relax. I believe you. I'll consider killing your boss. See you around.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Relax. I believe you. I'll consider killing your boss. See you around."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat sniffles quietly."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Yeah... see you around.")),"setOfficeRatState","refused","next","end"))))))(set:$OfficeRatRefusedDialogue to (dm:"npcName","Office Rat","playerName","You","playerPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/zH6zBCBq/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-03-39.png","npcPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/JDwtXg9/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-00-06.png","background","https://i.ibb.co/mrDs3wBb/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-22-2026-at-06-05-48-PM.png","exitPassage","Your Office","openingEvents",(a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat cautiously emerges from the mouse hole, still carrying his briefcase."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Changed your mind?")),"stages",(a:(dm:"id","start","choices",(a:(dm:"label","...Okay. I'll kill your boss.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","...Okay. I'll kill your boss."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat stares at you, hardly daring to believe what he heard. His ears slowly perk up."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Really? Thank you. His office is inside the crevice behind the kitchen cupboards. And remember—the Golden Stars are yours when it's done.")),"setOfficeRatState","accepted","next","end"),(dm:"label","No.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","No."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat's ears droop slightly."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Fair enough... thanks for the cheese anyway."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","He retreats into the mouse hole with his briefcase dragging behind him.")),"next","end"))))))(set:$OfficeRatAcceptedDialogue to (dm:"npcName","Office Rat","playerName","You","playerPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/zH6zBCBq/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-03-39.png","npcPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/JDwtXg9/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-00-06.png","background","https://i.ibb.co/mrDs3wBb/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-22-2026-at-06-05-48-PM.png","exitPassage","Your Office","openingEvents",(a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat cautiously emerges from the mouse hole."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Any luck?")),"stages",(a:(dm:"id","start","choices",(a:(dm:"label","Still working on it.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","Still working on it."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat nods slowly, trying not to look disappointed."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Right. Of course. These things take time... apparently.")),"next","end"),(dm:"label","I've changed my mind... I'm gonna murder you instead!","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","I've changed my mind... I'm gonna murder you instead!"),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat freezes. The briefcase slips from his paw and lands with a tiny thud."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Oh... well... that's considerably less ideal.")),"next","betrayalChoice"))),(dm:"id","betrayalChoice","choices",(a:(dm:"label","I'm joking.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","I'm joking."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat stares at you in complete silence."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","That's a terrible joke. Please go kill the correct rat.")),"next","end"),(dm:"label","I'm serious.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","I'm serious."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat bares his tiny teeth and kicks his briefcase aside."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Fine. Let's go, punk.")),"setOfficeRatState","dead","destination","Start Office Rat Battle","next","end"))))))(set:$OfficeRatBossKilledDialogue to (dm:"npcName","Office Rat","playerName","You","playerPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/zH6zBCBq/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-03-39.png","npcPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/JDwtXg9/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-00-06.png","background","https://i.ibb.co/mrDs3wBb/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-22-2026-at-06-05-48-PM.png","exitPassage","Your Office","openingEvents",(a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat rushes excitedly from the mouse hole, nearly tripping over his own briefcase."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","You did it! I can't believe you actually did it! I feel... free.")),"stages",(a:(dm:"id","start","choices",(a:(dm:"label","You mentioned a reward.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","You mentioned a reward."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat disappears into the darkness and returns dragging three Golden Stars."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Here. As promised. You know... I think I'm finally going to apply for that promotion.")),"addSTAR",3,"setOfficeRatState","rewardCollected","next","end"))))))(set:$OfficeRatRewardCollectedDialogue to (dm:"npcName","Office Rat","playerName","You","playerPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/zH6zBCBq/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-03-39.png","npcPortrait","https://i.ibb.co/JDwtXg9/Screenshot-2026-07-21-at-01-00-06.png","background","https://i.ibb.co/mrDs3wBb/Chat-GPT-Image-Jul-22-2026-at-06-05-48-PM.png","exitPassage","Your Office","openingEvents",(a:(dm:"speaker","action","text","The office rat emerges from the mouse hole wearing the same oversized shirt, though his tie has been tightened with unusual confidence."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Oh. Hello again.")),"stages",(a:(dm:"id","start","choices",(a:(dm:"label","How's the promotion going?","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","How's the promotion going?"),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat proudly straightens his tiny tie."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Pretty well. Turns out management is mostly meetings, nodding thoughtfully and pretending to understand spreadsheets. I'm naturally gifted.")),"next","end"),(dm:"label","I still can't believe I murdered your boss.","events",(a:(dm:"speaker","player","text","I still can't believe I murdered your boss."),(dm:"speaker","action","text","The rat glances cautiously toward the darkness behind him."),(dm:"speaker","npc","text","Neither can I. Please don't develop