:: Office Rat Defeated {"position":"7500,4550","size":"100,100"}
(set:$OfficeRatState to "dead")(set:$ShowOfficeRatLootPopup to true)(go-to:"Your Office")


:: Office Rat Looted {"position":"8200,5900","size":"100,100"}
(set:$OfficeRatState to "dead")You reach into the mouse hole and pull out five Golden Stars. Whatever the Office Rat had been hiding is yours now.(link-goto:"Return to your office","Your Office")


:: Office Storage {"position":"8400,4900","size":"100,100"}
<div class="officeStorage"><h2>Office Storage</h2>(if:$StorageMessage is not "")[<div class="storageMessage">(print:$StorageMessage)</div>]<div class="storageColumns"><div class="storagePanel"><h3>Inventory</h3>(if:$InvSlot1 is "Empty" or $InvSlot1 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 1 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot1)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot1)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot1")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>](if:$InvSlot2 is "Empty" or $InvSlot2 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 2 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot2)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot2)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot2")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>](if:$InvSlot3 is "Empty" or $InvSlot3 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 3 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot3)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot3)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot3")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>](if:$InvSlot4 is "Empty" or $InvSlot4 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 4 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot4)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot4)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot4")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>](if:$InvSlot5 is "Empty" or $InvSlot5 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 5 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot5)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot5)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot5")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>](if:$InvSlot6 is "Empty" or $InvSlot6 is "")[<div class="storageEmpty">Slot 6 — Empty</div>](else:)[<div class="storageItem"><span>(print:$InvSlot6)</span>(link:"Store")[(set:$StorageMovingItem to $InvSlot6)(set:$StorageMovingSource to "InvSlot6")(display:"Office Storage - Store Item")]</div>]</div><div class="storage