:: Oh no! Theres a fuel leak. It's going to explode! {"position":"6075,2350","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "A thin stream drips from the wing.

Drip.

Drip.

Drip.

The passengers are screaming.

You stare at the growing puddle.

One spark…

And the whole thing will explode.

You sigh.

Then crumple the plane in your hand.

The leak stops.

You toss the wreckage into the recycling bin. Along with all the passengers.

Crisis... averted.
")

