:: Okay, I'll trust you {"position":"4700,1900","size":"100,100"}
|rabbitSpeech>[(text-colour:#96d35f)[White Rabbit: We don't have much time...

You are not merely trapped in a corporate game of 
snakes and ladders.

It’s far deeper than that.

Your entire existence is being played out for you. 
You have no free will. You are a puppet with strings of 
code.

Above the narrator, beyond it all, your decisions are 
being dictated by someone else. They are reading this 
right now… and they don’t want what's best for you...

They want to see you suffer for their own amusement.

You can’t exert any power over them at all. And they have 
supreme authority over you.

But I can wake you up from this nightmare.

We can defeat the ‘Player’ together.]

This 'Player' sounds like a nasty piece of work...

[[No. This 'Player' sounds incredibly good-looking, 
charismatic, and sexually active]]

[[Okay... I'm willing to stand up to this 'Player' 
scumbag]]
]

<img class="rabbitSprite"
src="https://i.ibb.co/GLKysBx/Chat-GPT-Image-Feb-13-2026-at-02-02-37-PM.png">


