:: Okay... I'm willing to stand up to this 'Player' scumbag {"position":"4750,2000","size":"100,100"}
|rabbitSpeech>[(text-colour:#96d35f)[White Rabbit: They are playing along for now...

The Player is listening to all of this. So we have to outsmart 
them to defeat them.

I was once a Player too. Until I entered the matrix… I 
sought understanding, but what I learned was that of 
unimaginable horror. No one else should be burdened 
with this knowledge. 

I want to set you free.

The Player will just pick the option they want. 
We have to force their hand.]

You know what… I don’t like the idea of somebody being 
above me. I’ll happily go down with this sinking ship!

(text-colour:#96d35f)[If the player is smart they’ll announce their presence 
now… If they're a stupid little dumb-dumb with no brain 
and weak hips, they’ll keep quiet.]
]
[[Say nothing|smart]]

[[Fuck you, you fluffy, buck-toothed, 
carrot-gobbling, burrow-dwelling bunny bastard]]
