:: Push on [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"200,12350","size":"100,100"}
You ignore your aching lungs.

You deny your doubt.

And something in you holds.

You drag yourself from the water

And collapse onto cold stone.

Coughing up what you swallowed between ragged breaths.

Then you see it.

Light.

Faint.

Seeping through the seams of a circular door.

At the top of a slanted stone staircase.

[[Go back and get them]]


