:: Quietly approach the other side of the egg [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"300,5350","size":"100,100"}
You reveal yourself, realising there is no threat here.

An old woman lies on the ground. Frail, collapsed into herself. The shell beside her has split open, though she looks far too weak to have escaped it.

She repeats the same phrase again and again. The words mean nothing to you, but the shape of them is human- breath catching, faltering. A voice racing against time.

Her eyes fix on you.

Desperate.

She lifts a trembling hand and touches her throat.

Understanding arrives slowly, then all at once.


She is caught in the throes of death, and she wants out.

(link: "Step back and try to make sense of things")[
	(set: $INTELLECT100 to $INTELLECT100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Step back and try to make sense of things")
]

[[Search around for a sharp enough bone fragment]]

[[Leave. It isn't safe to be around her|Leave and let her fade away on her own]]

(link: "Hold her hand and wait with her")[
	(set: $HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Hold her hand and wait with her")
]


