This isn't a very happy number!</div><div class="rehappiness-choices">(link-goto:"Sigh depressingly","Re-Happiness - Golden Star")(link-goto:"Sigh hopefully","Re-Happiness - Golden Star")</div></div><div class="rehappiness-mascot-panel"><img class="rehappiness-mascot" src="https://i.ibb.co/wZ4v72mb/Chat-GPT-Image-Feb-13-2026-at-05-31-17-PM-removebg-preview.png"></div></div></div><div class="office-computer-footer">ZERO PERCENT IS NOT A HAPPY NUMBER</div></div></div>


