:: Really? {"position":"0,2250","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Wait a second!

I'm sorry, you're right. That's a chapter for another game I'm working on. How embarrassing...

Let's do that again.
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
     
     [[-_-]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


:: Really? You have Jennifers number?! {"position":"8000,1500","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "I do indeed!

You want it?
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
|links>[ ]  <!-- hook for the links, initially empty -->

(live: 0.01s)[
  (if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is not $t)[
    (replace: ?tw)[(substring: $t, 1, $i)]
    (set: $i to $i + 1)
  ]
  (else-if: (substring: $t, 1, $i) is $t)[
    (replace: ?links)[
      [[Give it to me!]]
      
      [[I'd better not, she for sure has a family now...]]
    ]
    (stop:)
  ]
]


