elling.<br><br><strong>Primary Objective:</strong><br>Determine whether employees will recognise a synthetic colleague operating within a standard office environment.</div><div class="office-employee-section-title">CURRENT RESULTS</div><div class="office-employee-data-grid"><div class="office-employee-label">Operational Duration</div><div class="office-employee-value">3 years, 4 months</div><div class="office-employee-label">Detection Rate</div><div class="office-employee-value">0.0%</div><div class="office-employee-label">Camouflage Effectiveness</div><div class="office-employee-value">Exceeds projected expectations</div></div><div class="office-employee-text" style="margin-top:14px;">Employee reports suggesting Halley may be “a robot” have consistently been interpreted by colleagues as jokes.<br><br>Several employees instead concluded she is simply:<br><br>— Socially awkward<br>— Extremely enthusiastic<br>— Autistic<br>— “A bit quirky”</div><div class="office-employee-section-title">OBSERVATIONAL NOTES</div><div class="office-employee-text">Subject continues attempting humour.<br><br><strong>Current success rate:</strong> 4.2%<br><br>Employee Stanley continues laughing at every joke.<br><strong>Cause unknown.</strong><br><br>Subject has begun independently attending employee birthday celebrations despite not requiring food.<br><br>Cake consumption remains inefficient.<br><br>Subject requested annual leave.<br><br><strong>Reason provided:</strong><br>“To experience relaxation.”<br><br>Request approved.<br><br>Subject spent the entire leave period remaining powered on in her apartment watching birds.</div><div class="office-employee-section-title">PROJECT STATUS</div><div class="office-employee-data-grid"><div class="office-employee-label">Directive</div><div class="office-employee-value"><strong>CONTINUE OBSERVATION</strong></div><div class="office-employee-label">Employee Integration</div><div class="office-employee-value">Complete Success</div><div class="office-employee-label">Future Deployment</div><div class="office-employee-value">Replacement of additional personnel remains under consideration.</div></div><div class="office-employee-warning"><strong>FINAL RECORD NOTE</strong><br><br>Prototype Appearance Source: Personnel Record J-017 — Jennifer</div></div></div><div class="office-database-return"><div class="office-computer-menu">(link-goto:"RETURN TO EMPLOYEE DIRECTORY","Office Computer - Employee Profile")(link-goto:"RETURN TO TERMINAL","Office - Computer")</div></div></div><div class="office-computer-footer">OMEGA CORPORATION — OMEGA BLACK CLEARANCE — FILE ACCESS LOGGED</div></div></div>


