:: Sit back down [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"100,13275","size":"100,100"}
She strikes it again.

And again.

The chamber swallows the sound.

The door does not care how hard it is struck.

She stops.

Breath shudders through her.

Then she slides down the wall and disappears into herself.

A tear cuts a clean line through the grime on her cheek.

She turns her face from you.

[[We rest. Then double back]]

[[Sit down beside her]]


:: Sit down beside her [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"200,13400","size":"100,100"}
She turns her head toward you- just slightly- her face still hidden behind her hair.

A quiet moment passes.

She runs her hands through her hair.

Pulling at it.

A breath leaves her.

Her grip softens. She starts wringing the water from her hair.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: I… ]

She doesn't say it.

Her hands drop down, over her face.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[We... ]

[[Say nothing|saynut]]

[[Rest. We aren’t done yet]]


