:: So you'll help us get her sister back? [PanelLeft Guyh] {"position":"100,7900","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Yes.]

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Please.]

The word seems to blister against her mouth.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[What else is there?]

Her eyes are screaming for help.

But something she wears keeps it behind her gaze.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[I couldn’t save her once.]

She swallows.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[The other two in the cave- they don’t speak your language.]

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[You won’t understand them without the seal.]

Her jaw tightens.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[It lets you speak. And understand any… thing.]

Dan rises slowly.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I’ll take the seal.]

He draws in a long, exaggerated breath.

His chest lifts higher than it needs to.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I’ve already died once.]

A crooked grin stretches across his face.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[What’s the worst that can happen?]

(link: "If I do this, Koemi, anything that happens is on you")[
	(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "If I do this, Koemi, anything that happens is on you")
]

