:: So. What's the plan then? [Cliff PanelLeft] {"position":"100,9025","size":"100,100"}
Koemi nods and turns to Guyh.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: You found what you were looking for?]

Guyh does not look at her.

He hooks a finger into one nostril, absently.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Yes.]

He withdraws it, studies whatever he has found with detached curiosity.

Dan’s nose wrinkles. He doesn’t look away.

Rey brushes sand from his elbows.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[There is an entrance to the castle. An old sewer drain.]

He rubs his fingers together and lets the residue fall.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[It lies close.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Close to the creature that holds your sister.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[We wait until it returns to the castle.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Then we enter.]

[[Its castle?|sowhatsplan]]


:: So. What's the plan then?1 [Cliff PanelLeft] {"position":"100,9000","size":"100,100"}
Dan opens his mouth-

Then closes it again.

His hand rises, almost by reflex.

He rubs his lips instead.

[[...|So. What's the plan then?]]


:: So... anyway, are you single? {"position":"8050,2675","size":"100,100"}



:: Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"775,12275","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Don’t make us leave you here.]

You see sincerity in her eyes- and certainty.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Dan had good reason. Don’t make a mockery-]

The water convulses.

The air thins.

Rey slowly closes his mouth.

Koemi freezes.

Each breath feels sharp.

You cannot help but hold your breath.

It is in the chamber.

[[...|BEASTnoring]]


:: Sooo, you are Santa then? {"position":"600,3575","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:yellow)[ANSWER THE QUESTION.]

[[Nice]]
      
      [[Naughty]]
      
      [[I don't know]]


:: Sorry, I'm afraid there isn't {"position":"8150,2675","size":"100,100"}



:: Spare the boat. You are a benevolent leviathan {"position":"6675,2425","size":"100,100"}



:: Spit the blood onto the sand [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"50,8200","size":"100,100"}
The blood darkens the sand.

[[...|ko]]


:: Split it three ways. It’s fair- and no one’s left exposed [Glyphs PanelLeft] {"position":"200,17575","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Fair.]

(text-colour:lime)[Of course.]

He glances at Dan.

(text-colour:lime)[We’ll all be, equally vulnerable.]

He blinks at you. 

Dan rolls onto his side.

Grunts, forcing his muscles into motion.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I’ve got blood to give.]

(text-colour:lime)[Lie back down, Dan.

If you lose a drop more, you’ll die.]

Dan looks to Koemi.

She nods.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: So eager to sacrifice yourself.

It’ll lose its taste.]

Dan lingers on Guyh’s words, groans, and rolls onto his back.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I want a cup of tea.]

He rubs his face with his palms.

[[Koemi?]]

[[We'll get a cup of tea soon, Dan]]


