:: Start smashing your head against the wall {"position":"1600,2400","size":"100,100"}
(set: $BASH to true)
(set: $BOSSSTR to false)
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Hold up there, buddy!

This might go wrong...

We gotta see if your capable of killing yourself here.

You might just knock yourself out...

Or even worse.

Get permanent brain damage. You'd hate that. We'd have to hook you up to your computer and have you type out reports by blinking.


You'll certainly need to do a 'Strength Check'


Basically, I'll roll a dice, and add on your 'Strength Score'.

If you roll high enough, you pass the check and succeed.

However...

If you fail, you will take some 'Hit Point' damage, as well as any other complications.

You've only got 10HP, and this could do up to 4HP worth of damage, and leave you permanently incapacitated.


Are you certain you want to proceed?
")

