The beast steps forward.

It shifts its weight onto its hind legs.

Claws scraping stone.

[[Put the ring back on the finger]]

[[Throw the skeleton into the pool]]


:: Step back [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"700,17275","size":"100,100"}
Guyh lets the silence stretch.

He lowers his hand.

Slowly.

The smile returns.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Perhaps you are right.]

He tilts his head.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[It is broken.]

Fingers grazing his lip.

He steps away.

Then stops.

Squats.

[[What now then?]]


