|bossSpeech>[(text-colour:orange)[Boss: You think this is a game?!]

He leans forward, baring his teeth at you...

You can smell the coffee on his breath. 

(text-colour:orange)[Boss: You're behaving like a child. Meet me in my 
office, now!]

You can hear him stomping away across the office...

(if: $PEN is true)[(text-colour:orange)[Boss: I was going to give you your pen back if you played ball... but now, maybe I'll just keep it...](set: $BOSSHASPEN to true)]

