]


:: Step back and try to make sense of things [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"200,5475","size":"100,100"}
You step back, trying to make sense of it.

The broken shell. The angle of the cracks. The way it must have been forced open from the outside... not the inside.

The old womans body tenses. Her hands claw weakly at the sand. Her eyes are wide now, searching, pleading with something that isn’t there. A thin cry slips out of her, cut short as her breath fails to follow.

The fear stays on her face even after the movement stops.

Silence settles.

You feel someone watching.

You turn.

A young woman stands there, her gaze fixed on you, searching your face as though looking for something buried underneath it.

[[Did you break her out?|Untitled Passage1]]


:: Step forward [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"175,16950","size":"100,100"}
He sits down on the step.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: The mark. I don’t recall it clearly.]

He traces his finger through the air.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Two circles. Perhaps eyes. Or suns. Overlapping.

Dripping where they meet.]

You study his back.

Ridden with glyphs.

They do not look decorative.

Some are delicate. Artistry, even.  

Others look carved in haste- cut too deep, as though the hand that made them did not care what it ruined.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Above it. Or below it. There was something like flame.]

Some symbols almost resolve into meaning.

One depicts a body being torn clean in half.

Another- a horned face, mouth open in a silent roar.

[[What are they?]]


:: Step forward and offer the ring [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"2900,13000","size":"100,100"}
Your breath is torn from you.

Stone slams into your back.

Its claws close around your neck and chest- effortlessly.

Its pale face hangs over you.

Dripping.

A single word falls like acid.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: DIE.]
(set:$HP to $HP -1)

Its claws constrain your lungs.

You cannot speak.

You cannot breathe.

[[...|kosave]]
(set: $RING to true)


:: Step to the window. Throw it {"position":"5975,2050","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "With expert form, you let her rip.

An arm like a slingshot.

She cuts through the air with grace. With intent.

Riding a gentle breeze before whipping upward and careening into the sky.

She’s gaining height.

Higher and higher...

Up and up.

Straight for the sun.

You squint as she eclipses it.

Then higher still... 

Vanishing behind a fuzzy cloud.
")

