:: Survival is easier together [PanelLeft Mundane] {"position":"225,6225","size":"100,100"}
He finally lifts his head.

His eyes move over the shore, the cliff, the distant eggs.

For a moment, he looks more wounded by the sight than by his own skin.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Man: …survival…]

The sound of the shoreline chips away at what remains of your words.

You each fall silent.

[[...|Breath1]]
(if: $HUDPortraits is not an array)[(set: $HUDPortraits to (a:))]
(set: $HUDPortraits to $HUDPortraits + (a:"https://i.ibb.co/B2cC601b/oldman-border-006d8f.png"))


:: Survive [PanelLeft] {"position":"525,11700","size":"100,100"}
You feel yourself slipping.

There is a strange quiet beneath the pain.

The world tilts.

Hands seize you.

You are dragged backwards- metal bars scraping bone- as claws swipe where your face 
was a heartbeat ago.

You hit the stone hard.

Koemi grabs at you- you stagger to your feet. Rey is already moving.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: It’s going around.]

Before you can gather your breath.

You are running.

[[Keep running]]


:: Surviverage [PanelLeft] {"position":"625,11700","size":"100,100"}
