:: Take the path marked with a shallow circle [PanelLeft] {"position":"100,10950","size":"100,100"}
You proceed.

The darkness unravels before your torch.

The ticking of water matches your steps.

Then-

Dan stumbles.

His hand finds the wall.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I can’t.]

He is already sinking down.

His head lolls against the sloped stone.

(if: $SAVEDAN is false)[His wounds from the beach have bled through. Darker than before.

He avoids your eyes. Unwilling to cast blame.](else:)[(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I would say my age is catching up with me…]
	
	A faint smile.
	
	(text-colour:#006d8f)[But I think it overtook me long ago.]
]

