:: The banner. You tore it? [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"800,12800","size":"100,100"}
The shadows twitch.

Then lunge.

Your breath is torn from you.

Stone slams into your back.

Its claws close around your neck and chest- effortlessly.

A woman's pale face hangs over you. Dripping.

Her words fall like acid.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: I preserved what I could.]
(set:$HP to $HP -1)
It's claw constrains your lungs.

You cannot speak.

You cannot breathe.

[[...|kosave]]


:: The beast... [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"250,15500","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: I wouldn't call Rey a beast.]

The words curl at the edge of Guyh’s mouth.

Rey doesn't flinch.

A grin sharpens around his cheekbones.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: This smile is for me, Guyh.]

Guyh’s eyes flicker to Rey.

Then to you.

[[What was... it?]]


