:: Throw the ring away [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"2600,13000","size":"100,100"}
You do not think.

You let go.

The beast tracks it through the air-

And leaps after it.

The ring cuts through the hissing water.

Down into the black.

You turn.

Your legs move before you decide.

Rey is already running.

Koemi pivots and sprints.

The beast wails- a shrill burst.

More human than beast.

Claws rake the water behind you.

You are already gone.


:: Throw the skeleton into the pool [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"3000,13200","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:red)[Beast: NO.]

The beast wails- a shrill burst.

More human than beast.

It tracks the skeleton through the air-

And leaps after it.

The bones shatter against the stone.

Fragments tumble into the black.

The water peels flakes from them.

As if finishing what time began.

Your legs move before you decide.

Rey is already running.

You turn.

Koemi pivots and sprints.

Claws rake the water behind you.

You are gone.
(set: $RING to true)
[[Keep running|donsto2]]


