:: Watch it carefully [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"500,5100","size":"100,100"}
You stand back and study it. You glimpse a small crab like creature with a human head. It reveals itself momentarily before disappearing deep into the sand. As you watch you notice lots of similar little shifts in the sands around you...

They are everywhere.

Their movement looks chaotic, but you are on the cusp of noticing a pattern.

