		(go-to: "Attempt to discern")
	](else:)[
		(go-to: "Attempt to discernfail")
	]
]


:: Watch it carefullyfail [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"575,5100","size":"100,100"}
You fail to get a good look at the creature before it disappears into the depths of the sands.


You hear a voice, eke out just enough breath to catch your ear.

The words are too quiet to make out, but they come from the other side of the egg you are standing beside.

