:: We can't leave her [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"100,8800","size":"100,100"}
Guyh chuckles softly.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: We can.]

He shifts his weight, almost lazily.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[We could blind her. Cripple her. Unmake her piece by piece.]

A pause.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[And then we could leave her.]

Silence settles.

Dan scowls before he can stop himself.

Rey does not look at Guyh.

He looks at you.

Koemi’s eyes remain fixed on the cave.

No one speaks.

