:: We rest. Then double back [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"75,13400","size":"100,100"}
She turns her head toward you- just slightly- her face still hidden behind her hair.

A quiet moment passes.

She runs her hands through her hair.

Pulling at it.

A breath leaves her.

Her grip softens. She starts wringing the water from her hair.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: I… ]

She doesn't say it.

Her hands drop down, over her face.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[We... ]

