:: We've lost both engines. Prepare for emergency landing! {"position":"6075,2250","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "The engine sputters. Mayday, mayday!

The plane begins to fall.

The passengers are screaming.

You search desperately for a runway.

The desk approaches.

Fast.

Too fast!

You brace for impact.

The plane slams into a stapler, ricochets across a stack of quarterly reports, and skids to a stop beside a coffee mug.

Silence.

You wipe sweat from your brow.
")

