:: Well? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"450,17775","size":"100,100"}
A violent sound tears from Guyh.

He doesn’t break eye contact.

Something heavy drops to the stone behind him.

Wet.

Unapologetic.

Like a rope drenched in black ink.

It coils on the floor beneath him.

Splashing against his ankles.

He blinks once.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Let me think.]

Another release.

He exhales through his nose.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Earlobe!]

He half rises- then sinks back into a squat.

Shakes his head.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[No.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[It’s a name.]

He chews the side of his finger.

Grumbling.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Earrrrrl… Er… Erlo…]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Erlob!]

A low hum builds in his throat.

Almost a purr.

He sways once on his heels, pleased with himself.

Then skips back toward the door.


