:: We’re all risking our lives here. If anyone should make the sacrifice, it’s Koemi [Glyphs PanelLeft] {"position":"325,17575","size":"100,100"}
Koemi’s mouth opens- but no words come.

Rey lifts a hand toward you.

Not quite pointing.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: You’re right.]

(text-colour:lime)[We could tally everyone’s debt.]

He folds his arms across his chest.

(text-colour:lime)[Or we could do the right thing.]

Dan rolls onto his side.

Grunts, forcing his muscles into motion.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I’ve got blood to give.]

(text-colour:lime)[Lie back down, Dan.

If you lose a drop more, you’ll die.]

Dan looks to Koemi.

She nods.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: So eager to sacrifice yourself.

It’ll lose its taste.]

Dan lingers on Guyh’s words, groans, and rolls onto his back.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I want a cup of tea.]

He rubs his face with his palms.

[[Koemi?]]

[[We'll get a cup of tea soon, Dan]]


:: What about your blood? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"200,17200","size":"100,100"}
A violent sound tears from Guyh.

He doesn’t break eye contact.

Something heavy drops to the stone behind him.

Wet.

Unapologetic.

Like a rope drenched in black ink.

It coils on the floor beneath him.

Splashing against his ankles.

The smell is rancid.

He blinks once.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: My blood.]

Another release.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Is worthless.]

He exhales through his nose.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Your blood.]

He coughs.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Is pure.]

He rises with a slow inhale- as though drawing breath from somewhere deeper than lungs.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[The veins of Thessal spilled across Tartyr. 

With it-  life. 

Death was swallowed. Forever drowning in absolution.

Hurasmus, son of Thessal, gave his hand to Death.

For ten thousand years he refused.

Until the sea ran black, he refused.

Then it hardened into stone.]

His tongue curls around each vowel. 

He draws the names long.

His expression does not match the weight of the words.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Thessal...]

Koemi pupils bounce around from one thought to another.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[...what happens if we die here?]

[[...|death?]]


:: What are they? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"200,17075","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Hm.]

Guyh looks up at you, meeting your eyes.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Memories.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[The only good kind. The ones with use.]

You find the mark he described.

Two suns. Overlapping.

Flame dripping where they meet- like tears.

You trace your fingers over it.

Guyh rises before you’ve finished.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Keen eyes.]

He freezes. 

Then his gaze drifts- from one face to the next.

Then back to you.

He does not look at Dan.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I told you it would be costly.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[These glyphs are not free.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I will need blood. As much as you can give.]

A small grin tugs at the corner of Guyh’s mouth.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[If one of you gives- it might kill you.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[If two- you’ll suffer greatly, but survive.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[If three- you’ll all be weak.]

He pauses for a moment.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Decide amongst yourselves.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[We are equals after all.]

He steps away.

Then stops.

Squats.

[[What about your blood?]]


:: What are you? [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"50,7200","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: I am just like you.]

A faint smile.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[But more pretty on the eyes.]

His pupils widen, just a little.

They do not leave you.

[[How do you know him, Koemi?|How do you know him?]]


:: What do you expect of me? [Koemi PanelLeft] {"position":"450,5800","size":"100,100"}
Her gaze sharpens toward the castle in the distance.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: I’m going there.]

[[Why?]]

[[Wait, what is this place?|Why?]]

[[Who are you?|Why?]]


:: What do you last remember? [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"350,6850","size":"100,100"}
His hand rises to his forehead, as if he can press the memory back into place.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Man: I… I was at home. Just doing nothing. Watching TV.]

He squints, as though staring into a bright light.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I can’t remember what was on.]

A pause.

Too long.

He shakes his head sharply, as if scolding himself.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[No. No, I... I fell.]

His eyes lift to the sky, wide, unblinking.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I fell down the stairs.]

The words land heavily. He tests them.

Then...

He begins to laugh.

It comes out wrong. Too loud. Too sharp.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[I died falling down the stairs!]

He laughs harder.

And harder.

His shoulders tremble.

The laughter thins, stretched tight over something breaking beneath it.

[[...|lastremember]]


:: What do you mean, wield? [PanelLeft Koemi] {"position":"350,5700","size":"100,100"}
She places a bone dagger into your hands.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: Kindness doesn’t cut. 

But no one makes it alone.]

Her gaze sharpens toward the castle in the distance.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[I’m going there.]

[[Why?]]

[[Wait, what is this place?|Why?]]

[[Who are you?|Why?]]


:: What do you want in return? [PanelLeft Koemi] {"position":"475,5800","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: Nothing. We both have something to protect.]

Her gaze sharpens toward the castle in the distance.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[I’m going there.]

[[Why?]]

[[Wait, what is this place?|Why?]]

[[Who are you?|Why?]]


:: What makes you so sure we want to help you? [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"75,7400","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: I am growing impatient.]

He rocks his head from side to side like a fussy child.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You would not be able to even talk with her if it weren't for me.]

He smiles.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Do not pout, Koemi. Stick out your tongue.]

He unravels his own long black tongue. On it, you can just discern a glyph- imprinted like a brand.

Koemi bites her tongue inside her mouth.

Guyh prods her with his gaze.

Reluctantly, she unfurls it.

She too bears the mark.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[A seal of understanding.]

His eyes slide to you.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I gave to her freely. And to you too I will give.]

He extends his arms, palm up.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[But that is not all I offer.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[That is a handshake.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I offer you.]

He savours the word.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Hope.]

(link: "Your tongue matches your words")[
	(set: $PERCEPTION100 to $PERCEPTION100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We don’t need your hope")
]

(link: "Speak plainly. What do you want from us?")[
	(set: $FORCE100 to $FORCE100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We don’t need your hope")
]

(link: "What does the seal do?")[
	(set: $INTELLECT100 to $INTELLECT100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We don’t need your hope")
]

(link: "We don’t need your hope")[
	(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "We don’t need your hope")
]


:: What now then? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"700,17400","size":"100,100"}
Your words are cut short.

A violent sound tears from him.

He doesn’t break eye contact.

Something heavy drops to the stone behind him.

Wet.

Unapologetic.

Like a rope drenched in black ink.

It coils on the floor beneath him.

Splashing against his ankles.

He blinks once.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Opening the door.]

Another release.

He exhales through his nose.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Will be costly.]

The smell reaches Rey.

A cough- barely masking a retch.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: For God’s sake. Give him the ring.]

Koemi looks to you, concern plain in her eyes.

Dan watches through half-closed lids.

[[Fine. Inspect the ring if you must]]

[[I've made my decision. I'm willing to pay the cost]]


