Her hands begin to tremble. Nails biting into skin.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Woman: For-get.]

She rakes her fingers through her hair.

(text-colour:#d29d00)[Woman: For-get.]

She grips her head with each repetition.

The word breaks apart in her mouth.

Fragments slip loose between sobs- names, places.

Then only shaking.

[[Please]]


:: You're not human2 [PanelLeft Guyh] {"position":"50,7100","size":"100,100"}
Koemi has relaxed.

But both hands remain wrapped around her club.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: This is Guyh.]

Guyh stands motionless.

Her eyes finally move away from him.

To you.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[He is helping us.]

[[What are you?]]


:: You're not the boss of me! {"position":"4100,700","size":"100,100"}
|bossSpeech>[
(text-colour:orange)[Boss: Actually that's exactly what I am. Do you wan't 
written up for insubordination? On top of the ongoing HR 
complaint against you?!]

