]


:: You're right. Quick [PanelLeft] {"position":"1400,12000","size":"100,100"}
You leave.

The chamber vanishes behind a shallow bend.

The smell of death follows you, urging you onward.

The grumbling rises- almost a cry.

You move further from it.

For now.

The grumbling does not fade.

It follows.

The passage splits in two.

Familiar markings etched into the stone.

[[Three diagonal scratches|diagonal]]

(if: $VERTICAL is false)[ [[Three vertical gouges|vertical]] ]


