:: Your castle [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"1300,13100","size":"100,100"}
The word cuts through the air. 

(text-colour:red)[Beast: His.]

She steps from the shadow.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: Taken.]

[[His throne is up there. Not here.]]

[[We will take it back. For him]]

[[We will bring you the head of the usurper]]


:: Your jewellery box. It seems fit for a queen [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1725,12800","size":"100,100"}
It treads the edge of shadow.

(text-colour:red)[Duchess.]

Her voice has softened.

(text-colour:red)[Before... they... unmade.]

[[Unmade what?]]


:: Your words are enough [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"0,16525","size":"100,100"}
Guyh smiles.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: A formality.]

He lowers his hand.

Slowly.

Rey steps forward.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: You can toy with our curiosity.]

He draws a steady breath.

(text-colour:lime)[But some answers are necessary.]

(text-colour:lime)[You said the castle was abandoned.]

[[...|abandoned]]


:: You’re not human [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"150,7100","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Strange Figure: I am just like you.]

A faint smile.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[But more pretty on the eyes.]

His pupils widen, just a little.

They do not leave you.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You have not introduced me, Koemi.]

His head tilts slightly.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[To your new friends.]

[[...|Koemi?2]]


:: abandoned [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"225,16575","size":"100,100"}
Guyh steps fully into the light spilling from behind the door.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Mhm.]

He looks up at the door.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Doesn’t seem to be.]

He begins climbing the stairs. Head lowered.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You know… some things I do not know the answer to.]

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Then tell us what you do know.]

Her words jab at his back.

Guyh stops.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Mhm.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[The indentured overthrew their lord…]

He pauses.

As if considering the shape of his own words.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[He was more thessalyn than daemon.]

He resumes climbing.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Ironic that the uprising began in such a place…]

He stops in front of the door.

His hand glances over the markings.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[This light is unknown to me.]

[[Uprising?]]

[[More thessalyn than daemon?|Uprising?]]


:: airliner {"position":"5300,975","size":"100,100"}
(set: $SUNBOSS to true)
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Before you have time to respond. Their head swivels away, as they turn to face their office door.


A moment later you see their boss come into the room...


Then...


The boss knees them in the balls.

He smashes the keyboard across their face.

He grabs their nipples and twists them ferociously.

He grabs their head and smashes it onto the desk... 

Repeatedly...

Harder and harder each time.

Then. KABOOOOM!

The commerical airliner crashes into the tower. Putting an abrupt end to their brawl.


Simultaneously, you hear a knock on your door...
")

