:: appbox [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1600,11700","size":"100,100"}
Inside, a broken hair comb.

Its teeth snapped and uneven.

Beneath it-  the remnants of a letter.

Or what was once a letter.

Only dust now.

The faint scent of something long gone lingers for a breath.
(set: $BOX to true)
[[...|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]


:: appheraldry [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1500,11700","size":"100,100"}
A banner hangs behind the skeleton- torn in twain.

Not cut.

Torn.

Blood dried on it long ago.

Now no colour remains.

Only the yellow of decay.

Most of the symbols have faded.

Except one.

Split between the two fragments- a pair of shackles.

A chain runs between them, stretched across the tear.

One manacle binds a sword.

The other, a hand.
 
The grumbling presses in from every side.
(set: $HERALDRY to true)
[[...|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]


:: apppool [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1700,11700","size":"100,100"}
The pool is murky and black.

A loose iron bar leans into it- partially dissolved.

The smell burns your nostrils.

Debris skims its surface, slowly drifting toward the centre.

It drains somewhere far below.

Drop by drop.

Revolution by revolution.

You look up the shaft.

At its peak, a metal grate- barring all but your gaze.

Beyond it, an illuminated room.

You glimpse only the ceiling.

The stonework above is ornate- cut like a dwelling, not a sewer.

The castle sits above you.

The sewers answer.

The low grumbling rises.
(set: $POOL to true)
[[...|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]


:: appskeleton [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1800,11700","size":"100,100"}
The skull is propped upright.

Almost proudly.

Parts have been set back into place- bound together with cord.

The bones are polished.

Untouched by fang or claw.

On its wedding finger hangs a gold-crested ring.

Etched with the likeness of a woman.

As your fingers near the bone, the faint warmth in the chamber shifts.

The water in the pool trembles.

A low groan lingers in the air.

[[Withdraw your hand|wyh]]

[[Take the ring|ttr]]
(set: $SKELETON to true)


:: away [PanelLeft Shore] {"position":"100,9825","size":"100,100"}
The cave vanishes behind the cliff face.

Sand gives way to stone.

The shoreline laps at the rocks beneath you.

The wind whistles.

Then rises.

For a moment it sounds like a distant scream.

Your ears prick. You listen.

Trying to discern.

But after a while, you stop acknowledging the possibility.

Guyh walks ahead.

Koemi doesn’t look back.

Dan watches his own feet.

They drag.

You cannot tell whether he is short of breath from the walk- or if he ever truly caught it back.

Rey moves silently behind you.

As the last of the light slips away, your destination reveals itself.

[[...|sewerentrance]]


:: backwards [PanelLeft] {"position":"775,11000","size":"100,100"}
Time has forgotten itself in here.

Each footstep resets it in your mind.

On and on.

Forever.

You no longer know which way is forward

Every branching path bends back on itself.

With each turn, the grumbling grows louder.

The weight of the darkness smothers you.

And before you can react-

Something immense tears you from your feet.

There is no time to react.

No time to call out.

The darkness swallows you.
(set: $HP to 0)
[[...|You Have Died]]


