:: cave [PanelLeft Cave] {"position":"200,8900","size":"100,100"}
Your eyes strain through the blanket of darkness.

At first, there is only rock.

Then the rock breathes.

She is there.

Silent. Folded in on herself.

Her arms cinched tight around her legs.

Her head buried against her knees.

Skin wrinkled- carved by a long life. 

The same colour as the stone.

If not for the white of her hair, you might have missed her entirely.

Your shadow shifts across the cave wall.

Her fingers tighten.

Her shoulders draw inward, as though you have become the cold.

(link: "I'm $PlayerName. What is your name?")[
	(set: $HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "I'm $PlayerName. What is your name?")
]

(link: "You won’t find peace here")[
	(set: $INTELLECT100 to $INTELLECT100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "You won’t find peace here")
]

(link: "Come. Or stay and wither")[
	(set: $FORCE100 to $FORCE100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
	(go-to: "Come. Or stay and fade")
]


