:: circle [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1275,11400","size":"100,100"}
You find yourself in a spherical chamber.

A junction where all paths converge.

A fetid pool lies still at its centre.

The air smells metallic and sour.

It reeks of death- and of something that still lives here.

Molted skin.

Gnawed bones.

Every surface is filmed with a pale chalk residue.


Above the pool, a shaft rises above and beyond.

From above, a thin column of light cascades down.

It flickers.

The light of a flame.

The chamber is littered with waste and bones.

But also intention.

A broken mirror sits upright.

Torn heraldry hangs from an old banner.

A jewellery box rests carefully upon a mound of filth.

On a crumbling wooden chair sits a skeleton.

Intact. Mostly.

Something glistens on its finger.


The faint warmth in the chamber has not faded.

Whatever lives here is not far.

(link: "Approach the skeleton")[
	(set: $SKELETON to true)
	(go-to: "Approach the skeleton")
]

(link: "Examine the pool and the shaft above")[
	(set: $POOL to true)
	(go-to: "Examine the pool and the shaft above")
]

(link: "Open the jewellery box")[
	(set: $BOX to true)
	(go-to: "Open the jewelery box")
]

(link: "Examine the heraldry")[
	(set: $HERALDRY to true)
	(go-to: "Examine the heraldry")
]

[[Leave the chamber]]

(set: $POOL to false)
(set: $SKELETON to false)
(set: $HERALDRY to false)
(set: $BOX to false)
(set:$CIRCLE to true)


:: circle2 [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"900,11900","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s eyes drop from the shaft above the pool.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: We’ve seen enough.]

Koemi stands over the jewellery box. Still.

She lowers the lid gently.

Then turns.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: We go. It’s drawing close.]

[[One moment]]

[[Nod]]


:: circle2.5 [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1100,11900","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s eyes drop from the shaft above the pool.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: We’ve seen enough.]

Koemi stands over the jewellery box. Still.

She lowers the lid gently.

Then turns.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: We go. It’s drawing close.]

Her eyes flick to your hand.

To the ring.

Then to the skeleton.

Then back to you.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Put it back.]

Her jaw sets

