:: climb2 [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"200,13150","size":"100,100"}
The door is metal. Thick.

You press against it.

Cold iron.

It does not yield.

An insignia is carved into it.

A cracked heart.

The seams are narrower than your fingers.

No keyhole.

Only a shallow impression where one should be.

An outline pressed into the metal.

A face.

[[Hammer your fists against it]]

[[Give me the club, Koemi]]

(if: $RING is true)[ [[Place the face of the ring into the impression|Place the face of the ring against the impression]] ]


