:: danback [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"150,14450","size":"100,100"}
Dan’s eyes flare open.

The whites constrict around his iris.

A lungful of black water erupts from his mouth in a wrenching cough.

He clutches his chest.

Rolls onto his side.

Draws in long, desperate breaths.

Koemi falls back.

A pained laugh escapes her.

Rey’s gaze moves between Dan and Guyh.

As though measuring the distance between them.

Dan’s eyes close again.

He breathes as if relearning how.

Slow.

Careful.

Koemi takes his hand in hers.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Dan.]

A faint grin finds Dan’s face.

His other hand lifts weakly from the stone.

Not toward anyone.

Just up.

Rey shifts forward- 

The moment stretches.

[[Take his hand]]

[[Let Rey take it]]


