:: death? [PanelLeft Glyphs] {"position":"200,17325","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: You pack your things.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Everyone wishes you farewell.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You shuffle back into your egg.]

Guyh feigns a yawn, his words slowing as they fall.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[And drift back into your little dream. Fast asleep.]

He claps his hands together.

Sharp.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Please.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Let’s focus on Ima. For now.]

Koemi’s eyes flare at Guyh.

Rey lifts his hands in a placating gesture.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Let’s get on with this. Guyh’s entitled to his secrets.]

His gaze dips briefly.

(text-colour:lime)[I wouldn’t put too much stock in them…]

Rey draws out a slow breath.

Then turns to you.

(if: $RINGLINGERED is true)[ (text-colour:lime)[You nearly got us killed- over a meaningless ring.

You know what needs to be done.] ](if: $LINGERED is true)[
(text-colour:lime)[You nearly got us killed- lingering in the beast’s lair.

You know what needs to be done.] ](text-colour:lime)[If you’re not willing to make the sacrifice, we split the blood three ways. Simple.]

His eyes search yours for hesitation.

Koemi waits.

[[I’ll do it. You two being strong gives us the best chance of rescuing Koemi’s sister]]

[[How about you make the sacrifice, Rey? Or do you only talk about it?]]

[[Split it three ways. It’s fair- and no one’s left exposed]]

[[We’re all risking our lives here. If anyone should make the sacrifice, it’s Koemi]]

[[I’m not giving my blood. I’m already weak. You and Koemi handle it]]


