:: flashback [Carry] {"position":"125,15150","size":"100,100"}
(align:"=><=")[(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: You'll get sick sitting in this filth.]

Dan is in his arms before a reply can form.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Death hasn't earned you, thessalyn.]

Motion. 

[[...|jumpback]]]


:: flashback3 [Carry] {"position":"125,15450","size":"100,100"}
(align:"=><=")[(text-colour:red)[Beast: ...Blacktongue.]

The word clings to the back of its throat.

It almost curdles into a growl.

Then- silence.

Guyh does not move.

Not yet.

He waits.

Until he is sure.

Then he answers the silence.

One foot.

Then the other.

[[...|jumpback3]]]


:: forward [Eggs PanelLeft] {"position":"50,6350","size":"100,100"}
The walk is long enough for thought to thin.

Your body does not thin.

It remembers.

Hunger. Cold. Aching knees. Split skin.

You try to speak to the stranger leading you, but she hushes you with a raised hand.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: Keep to the shadows.]

[[...|forward2]]


:: forward2 [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"50,6475","size":"100,100"}
A faint hissing swells into a gushing roar behind you.

Water slithers forward between the eggs, gathering into a low, deliberate surge.

Chitinous creatures scatter in frantic arcs. One crab is caught mid-scramble- the water takes it.

It dissolves.

The stranger has seen enough.

Her eyes snap to you.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Stranger: Run.]

Her legs already have.

[[...|forward3]]


:: forward3 [PanelLeft Eggs] {"position":"425,5950","size":"100,100"}
Your calves and lungs are burning. 

You see ahead, a raised sand embankment. 

Safety. 

As you pass an egg, the shell splits. 

Arms burst through the fracture- clawing, desperate.

The tide is almost upon you.

If you stop, you may not make it.

If you don’t, they won’t.

(link: "Go back and help pull them out")[
	(set: $HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(display: "UpdateStats")
    (set: $HP to $HP - 1)
(set: $SAVEDAN to true)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
		(go-to: "Go back and help pull them out")]

(link: "Keep running, your legs have already made their decision")[
	(set: $INSTINCT100 to $INSTINCT100 + 1)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
		(go-to: "Keep running, your legs have already made their decision")]


:: forwards [PanelLeft] {"position":"1200,10900","size":"100,100"}
Time has forgotten itself in here.

Each footstep resets it in your mind.

The grumbling has faded to a hum.

You have shaken it.

For now.

But you have also lost yourself.

Koemi’s voice anchors you.

She is behind you now.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: $PlayerName, wait.]

Between breaths.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[We’ve lost it… for now.]

A pause.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[But in the dark, we are the ones who are lost.]

Behind Koemi, you hear Rey’s breathing- controlled, but heavier than before.

Dan’s voice drifts from somewhere beyond that.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I can’t keep…]

A ragged inhale.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[…going like this.]

You feel her hand find your arm.

Firm.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[I’m lighting the torch.]

(link: "Inhale")[
	(set:$PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(go-to: "Light the torch")
]

(link: "Exhale")[
	(set:$INSTINCT100 to $INSTINCT100 + 1)
	(go-to: "Light the torch")
]


