:: gbagt [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"175,12775","size":"100,100"}
They cough.

They spit.

Their breathing turns shallow.

Then their eyes fix on the door.

A quiet victory.

Silence settles.

But you hear only Dan’s voice in your head.

What he would have said.

[[...|door]]


:: geb {"position":"625,2100","size":"100,100"}
The figure scuttles off, back into the shadows.

[[And don't come back!|beg]]


:: goback2 [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"300,12450","size":"100,100"}
You wake coughing.

Stone beneath your cheek.

Your chest burns like you’ve swallowed fire.

Koemi kneels over you, water dripping from her hair.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Thought we’d lost you.]

Rey stands with his arms folded, watching.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Looks like you caught on the rocks.]

Her eyes linger on you- a warning meant only for you.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[There’s another chamber. Try to be more careful.]

She helps you to your feet.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[We go together this time.]

[[Nod|goback3]]


:: goback3 [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"75,12775","size":"100,100"}
Koemi leads the way.

You and Rey follow.

Into the murky, frigid abyss.

You feel her movements ahead of you-

The faint push of her feet against stone.

Your chest begins to tighten.

But there is a calm in certainty.

You claw your way from the water.

Dragging yourself onto rough stone.

Coughing up its foulness between ragged breaths.

You wipe your eyes.

And then you see it.

Light.

Faint.

Seeping through the seams of a circular door.

At the top of a slanted stone staircase.

A quiet victory.

Silence settles.

But you hear only Dan’s voice in your head.

What he would have said.

[[...|door]]


