:: hyc [PanelLeft Prison] {"position":"450,11875","size":"100,100"}
You find yourself in an open chamber.

The room is lined on either side with iron bars.

The back wall has collapsed, opening into another tunnel.

At first there is silence.

Then you hear it.

Soft. Dry.

A wheeze masquerading as a whisper.

Pained breaths eke out from behind the bars.

Koemi raises the torch.

Gaunt, naked figures are strewn across the stone.

Not huddled together- fallen over one another.

As though none cared enough to move.

Some have no eyes at all.

Only empty sockets.

Others stare with cracked white orbs.

They notice you.

A twitch.

A slow turn of the head.

Nothing more.

The gate to their cage hangs open.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: What... are they?]

(link:"They were once human")[
	(set:$INTELLECT100 to $INTELLECT100 + 1)
	(go-to:"AshenResponse")
]

(link:"No different than us")[
	(set:$HUMANITY100 to $HUMANITY100 + 1)
	(go-to:"AshenResponse")
]

(link:"Damned")[
	(set:$PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(go-to:"AshenResponse2")
]

(link:"Leave them")[
	(set:$FORCE100 to $FORCE100 + 1)
	(go-to:"AshenResponse")
]

(link:"They are filth")[
	(set:$INSTINCT100 to $INSTINCT100 + 1)
	(go-to:"AshenResponse")
]


:: ijar [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1350,12375","size":"100,100"}
Rey’s gaze hardens.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Nothing is “just” anything down here.]

Rey stops.

His stance shifts, just enough to narrow your angle to the water.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Nothing is your decision alone.]

Only after her voice rises do you realise how quiet it has become.

Then-

The water trembles.

It is no longer in the tunnels.

Rey’s eyes widen.

Koemi freezes.

You cannot help but tense.

It is in the chamber.

[[...|BEAST]]


