:: ko [PanelLeft Cliff] {"position":"100,8300","size":"100,100"}
A cry breaks from within the cave.

Sharp.

Cut short.

The sound carries strangely through the stone.

Then nothing.

After a moment, Koemi steps back into the light.

Her shoulders sit high, as though she has not yet lowered them.

Her ear angles slightly toward the figure behind her.

He speaks close to her, though she does not turn to face him.

(text-colour:lime)[Man: I assure you, she deteriorates each time you step away. I do what I can for her. She does not possess your strength.]

You understand his words, but you feel you shouldn't.

When he steps from the shadows, he is already smiling.

He looks at Guyh first.

The smile does not fade.

His eyes remain there for a moment.

Then they move on.

Across each of you.

He lifts a hand.

The gesture pauses halfway- then completes itself into something like a greeting.

[[Okay?|Is everything ok?]]


:: koemireturn [PanelLeft Pool] {"position":"0,12325","size":"100,100"}
Koemi breaks the surface, gasping.

She rolls onto her back at the water’s edge.

Her spine arches with each desperate inhale.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: I… nearly… turned back.]

Each word costs her breath.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: I told you. Reckless.]

Before he can finish the word, Koemi pushes herself upright.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: I didn’t.]

She inhales sharply through her nose.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: There’s a path. 

Take all the breath you can before you go in.]

[[Nod|goback3]]


:: koko [PanelLeft Nobeast] {"position":"1975,12075","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Put it back.]

Her jaw sets.

[[Very well|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]

[[It stays with me|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]

[[It might have purpose|Something vital might be here. Wait. Less than a moment]]


:: kosave [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"1150,13450","size":"100,100"}
Its grip loosens.

You seize a breath from the foul air.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: NO.]

The word splits the chamber.

Koemi holds the skeleton over the bubbling pool.

A rib drops in.

The water peels flakes from the bone.

As if finishing what time began.

The beast releases you.

It lunges toward Koemi-

She lowers the skeleton closer.

Claws shriek against stone as they anchor.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: STOP.]

The word tears from her between ragged breaths.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: DEFILER.]

The pool shudders.

Out of the corner of your eye, Rey shifts.

Not toward Koemi.

Toward the exit.

[[Flee while you can]]

[[Stay with Koemi|You brought this on yourself]]


