:: ltt [PanelLeft] {"position":"0,10750","size":"100,100"}
The flame blooms- sudden and violent.

The shadows recoil.

Then settle, deeper than before.

The flame flickers sideways.

As if the labyrinth exhaled.

In the torchlight, the walls are not smooth.

Carvings.

Not decorative.

Directional.

[[...|ltt2]]


:: ltt2 [PanelLeft Puzzle] {"position":"100,10850","size":"100,100"}
The path you came from.

Etched with three shallow dots- arranged in a loose cluster.

Like eggs.

Elsewhere:

Three vertical gouges beside one tunnel.

A shallow circle carved beside another.

Repeated diagonal scratches leading deeper.

A light gust moves through the tunnels.

It carries the smell of death.

And something else.

Hunger.

