Koemi faces Guyh.

She is still.

Intent held.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: You left us.]

Breaths pause.

Guyh turns.

Looks down at her.

Over his shoulder.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: No.]

Still.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[You lost me.]

He lets it sit in the silence.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Like you must have lost Dan.]

