:: ptfor [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"475,13100","size":"100,100"}
The door is metal. Thick.

An insignia is carved into it.

A cracked heart.

The seams are narrower than your fingers.

No visible hinges.

No keyhole.

Only a shallow impression where one should be.

An outline pressed into the metal.

A face.

[[Place the face of the ring into the impression|ptfor2]]


:: ptfor2 [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"475,13225","size":"100,100"}
Blue light arcs through the carved insignia.

Along the cracks of the heart.

The door hums.

The light pulses.

Waiting.

As though asking a question.

One you cannot answer.

The door whimpers.

The light fades.

[[Hammer your fists against it]]

[[Give me the club, Koemi]]


