:: rebirth6 [f] {"position":"600,4825","size":"100,100"}
(align:"=><=")[The yolk depletes and you erupt violently into awareness.

You take a breath- not of air.

The fluid suspending you writhes down your throat and into your lungs. 

Panic detonates behind your eyes.

Your limbs thrash. Fingers scrape at the slick inner wall. Nails drag uselessly. The shell flexes but does not break.

You claw again. Harder.

A crack.

Light knifes through.

You force your head toward it, tearing the opening wider until air hits your face. It burns. 

Your lungs seize, then drag in a ragged breath that feels like glass.

You vomit remnants of the yolk that sustained you.

The shell splits wider.

You hang there, shaking, half-born into something that does not feel like life at all.

[[...|rebirth7]]]
(set:$HP to 10)
(set: $MaxHP to 10)


:: rebirth7 [Eggs PanelLeft f] {"position":"600,4950","size":"100,100"}
Panic subsides, and with it rises the dread of perception.

A white sand of crushed egg shells and bone cushions thousands upon thousands of eggs as far as the eye can see in all directions. The grains pinch your skin, and the shards threaten to tear it.

A great black ocean marks the threshold of the horizon, and far in the opposite direction juts a black mesa from the earth, of charcoal-like rocks and ridges cut through like the entrance to a great maze.

Atop it perches the ruins of a castle.

The sky hangs pale, almost bloodless.
Only a weak pulse of light moves behind the clouds.

Time pauses, waiting to see what you will become.

[[Whimper|Inspect the area]]

[[Hold it in|Inspect the area2]]
(set: $ShowHP to true)
(rerun: ?UIHEADER)


