:: sewerentrance [PanelLeft Drain] {"position":"100,9925","size":"100,100"}
A face is carved into the cliff itself.

A gargoyle.

It somehow looks older than the cliff- as though the stone had grown from it.

Its mouth forms the entrance.

Foul water trickles out.

The stench rolls toward you- bitter, metallic- settling on the tongue.

In the water, a statue kneels.

Its surface sealed in an eggshell mosaic.

It holds its own severed head up toward the gargoyle’s mouth.

Guyh kneels before it.

He mirrors the statue- touching his head, lifting his hands.

Then he inhales deeply.

Almost savoring the stench leaking from the gargoyle’s mouth.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: We go into Asfarion’s belly.]

[[Why did you mimic the statue?]]


