:: sttwti {"position":"6300,2050","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "With expert form, you let her rip.

An arm like a slingshot.

She cuts through the air with grace. With intent.

Riding a gentle breeze before whipping upward and careening into the sky.

She’s gaining height.

Higher and higher...

Up and up.

Straight for the sun.

You squint as she eclipses it.

Then higher still... 

Vanishing behind a fuzzy cloud.
")

