<audio autoplay style="display:none;">
<source src="https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/x2bmnngpwlyp78pns56bf/Brokeback-Ranch.m4a?rlkey=l4xzm3qi9j943t34lr16x3cx7&st=xjeyahvf">
</audio>

<div class="crawlRight">
	<div class="crawlWindow">
		<div class="crawlText">
		  
			<p>Oh yes.</p>
			<p>Sweaty men and lonely werewolves.</p>
			<p>They started as friends.</p>
			<p>And then in the end.</p>
			<p>They were lovers united.</p>
			<p>The moon confided in them.</p>
			<p>Aooo.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>


:: sy0.5 {"position":"6950,2900","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "Ah.

Right.

It seems I may have misread the chapter title earlier.

That's on me.

And... how could I forget.

I actually made a little jingle. 

For the trailer. 

When it's made into a movie.

Or perhaps a series...

...Broadway, maybe.

I think it would do better as a series.

Clive is a really deep character. 

A few hours just wouldn’t be enough to explore him properly.

Each nipple actually has it's own narrative arc...

Ah, sorry.

I'm ranting. 

Let's get on with it.

So... 
")

