  ]
  ]


:: sy2 {"position":"6950,3100","size":"100,100"}
(set: $i to 1)
(set: $t to "He sighed, reaching for another log.

His nipples were warm, but not toasty and hot the way he liked them.

He threw another log on the fire.

When the porch creaked beyond the door.

A stiff breeze slipped inside and kissed the fire, tickling his nipples on the way.

The lodge door stood wide open.

Clive didn’t turn around.

He already knew what kind of night this was going to be.

He sniffed.

And spat into the fire.
")

|tw>[ ]  <!-- hook for typewriter text -->
