:: thatwontdo2 {"position":"8525,1200","size":"100,100"}
|smileSpeech>[Smileboy begins to glitch and stutter. Disappearing and reappearing, looking slightly more distressed each time.

(text-colour:yellow)[Smileboy: How can this be possible!

