:: theabyss [PanelLeft] {"position":"100,10525","size":"100,100"}
Your footsteps have grown accustomed to the monotony.

Then something shifts.

It doesn’t reach realisation before Koemi’s shoulder strikes your chin.

Everyone halts.

Koemi whispers, her words clawing at the air in front of her.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: Guyh… Guyh…]

Silence.

You feel her turn toward you.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[He’s gone.]

The dark begins to disorient you.

The silence returns.

It waits.

