:: vertical [PanelLeft Gate] {"position":"400,11400","size":"100,100"}
Following the vertical gouges has led you to a barred gate.

Rusted. Ancient.

Still mostly intact.

Time has hollowed the iron in places.

Just wide enough for a body to slip through.

[[...|vertical2]]

(set:$VERTICAL to true)


:: vertical2 [PanelLeft Gate] {"position":"400,11500","size":"100,100"}
Something feels wrong.

It is too quiet.

Then-

The smell hits you.

It burns your nostrils.

Leaches into your throat.

Your hairs rise.

Beyond the bars.

At the edge of your torchlight.

The shadow does not retreat.

It watches.

You can feel it breathing.

Koemi’s hand presses across your chest.

A warning.

Do not move.

(if: $DAGGER is false)[
	(link: "Hold your composure and step through")[
		(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 2)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
        (go-to: "Hold your composure and step throughneverarmed")
	]
](else:)[
	(link: "Hold your composure and step through, gripping your dagger")[
		(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 2)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
		(set: $RollTotal to (random: 1, 6) + (random: 1, 6) + $PERSONA)
(set: $DAGGER to true)
		(if: $RollTotal >= 9)[
			(go-to: "Hold your composure and step througharmed")
		](else:)[
			(set: $HP to $HP - (random: 1, 6))
			(go-to: "Hold your composure and step througharmedfail")
		]
	]

(link: "Hold your composure. Set down your dagger and step through")[
		(set: $PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 2)
		(display: "UpdateStats")
			(go-to: "Hold your composure and step throughunarmed")
		
	]
]
(link: "Back away slowly")[
	(go-to: "Back away slowly")
]


