:: watch2 [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"62.5,13150","size":"100,100"}
You hear her testing the door.

Metal groans under her grip.

Scraping.

Then-

Like thunder trapped in bone.

Her club slams against the metal.

Once.

Again.

[[Stop!]]

[[Sit back down]]


:: water [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"150,14200","size":"100,100"}
Your thoughts retreat at the noise of bubbling water.

The water stirs.

Not violently.

Intentionally.

A white claw erupts.

Its nails scrape along the stone and wedge between cobbled seams.

Koemi steps forward.

The arm contracts- dragging something with it.

Guyh.

He hauls himself onto the stone.

Water dripping from his eyelids.

His legs are cinched tightly around Dan- folded, hooked, locked.

Knees bent too sharply.

Ankles crossed behind Dan’s spine.

For a moment it is unclear where one body ends and the other begins.

The limbs unfurl.

Dan rolls from him and lies still on the stone.

[[...|water2]]
(if: $HUDPortraits is not an array)[(set: $HUDPortraits to (a:))]
(set: $HUDPortraits to $HUDPortraits + (a:"https://i.ibb.co/w5D8bfb/demon-border-7f7f7f.png"))


:: water2 [PanelLeft Door] {"position":"150,14325","size":"100,100"}
Guyh’s shoulder hangs loose.

Wrong.

He plants his hand and forces it back into place.

A quiet crack.

For a moment he remains crouched.

Too low.

Too jointed.

Then he straightens.

Smoothly.

Something settles over him.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: You dropped this.]

Koemi is already over Dan.

Her mouth on his. 

Then-

Her hands locked at his chest.

She pushes down.

Again.

Again.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: Is he?]

Guyh cracks his jaw.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[He better not be.]

Koemi's pushes down.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[No point dragging a corpse.]

[[...|danback]]
