:: wcb [PanelLeft] {"position":"25,11175","size":"100,100"}
Dan nods, but doesn’t meet your gaze.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I know you would.]

He keeps his head lowered.

Afraid to retie the tether between you with a glance.

(text-colour:lime)[Rey: He’s made his choice.]

Rey draws in a slow breath.

Then lets it out.

(text-colour:lime)[Let him be.]

He shifts his posture- subtle, forward.

An invitation.

Koemi hesitates.

Dan doesn’t look up.

They go.

[[Leave]]
