:: wcb2 [PanelLeft] {"position":"100,11375","size":"100,100"}
No one speaks.

You let the sewers speak.

Droplets.

Trickling.

The flame humming.

A far-off sound- indistinct.

Doubt creeps up through your feet.

Through your knees.

You are cold.

You are tired.

But it is doubt that crawls over your skin.

Step after step.

Each one further from the last.

