:: weleave [PanelLeft Beast] {"position":"2800,12900","size":"100,100"}
Its claws dig into the stone.

It does not blink.

It leans toward you, neck craning.

(text-colour:red)[Beast: Give it to me.]

It edges closer.

Following its words.

[[Step forward and offer the ring]]

[[Step away from the pool and towards the skeleton]]

[[Drop the ring into the pool|Throw the ring away]]


:: weleavenow [Cliff PanelLeft] {"position":"100,9500","size":"100,100"}
Guyh sways once, then turns.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: This way.]

Koemi’s gaze lingers on the cave.

Dan walks beside her.

After a moment, he rests a hand lightly on her shoulder.

She lets herself be turned.

A small smile- just for him.

Then it is gone.

[[...|weleavenow2]]


