:: whatreturn [Guyh PanelLeft] {"position":"100,7800","size":"100,100"}
(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Guyh: Nothing.]

He lets the word linger.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Compared to holding her sister again.]

A faint shrug.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[A favour.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Not now.]

His eyes drift from one of you to the next.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[I see promise in her. In all of you.]

He chews thoughtfully at his fingernail.

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[No bindings. No pact.]

(text-colour:#7f7f7f)[Only the promise of gratitude.]

[[So you'll help us get her sister back?]]


