:: wkmcontinue [PanelLeft] {"position":"1000,10900","size":"100,100"}
Time has forgotten itself in here.

Each footstep resets it in your mind.

The grumbling has faded to a hum.

You have shaken it.

For now.

But you have also lost yourself.

Koemi’s voice anchors you.

She is behind you now.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[Koemi: $PlayerName, wait.]

Between breaths.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[We’ve lost it… for now.]

A pause.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[But in the dark, we are the ones who are lost.]

Behind Koemi, you hear Rey’s breathing- controlled, but heavier than before.

Dan’s voice drifts from somewhere beyond that.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[Dan: I can’t keep…]

A ragged inhale.

(text-colour:#006d8f)[…going like this.]

You feel her hand find your arm.

Firm.

(text-colour:#f1c9fe)[I’m lighting the torch.]

(link: "Inhale")[
	(set:$PERSONA100 to $PERSONA100 + 1)
	(go-to: "Light the torch")
]

(link: "Exhale")[
	(set:$INSTINCT100 to $INSTINCT100 + 1)
	(go-to: "Light the torch")
]


:: wkmcontinuefail [PanelLeft] {"position":"825,10875","size":"100,100"}
Panic sets in.

You move by instinct.

Your breathing grows heavy.

Each breath pulses through you- driving you forward.

You have lost all bearing.

There is only forward.

